<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">(WOL)</book>
  <para style="h">Macë</para>
  <para style="toc1">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu, ci jottalib Macë</para>
  <para style="toc2">Macë</para>
  <para style="toc3">Matthieu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu,</para>
  <para style="mt2">ci jottalib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Macë</para>
  <para style="ip">Mas ngaa xalaat ci dundug Almasi bi? Lu ko gàddaayloo mu jëm Afrig? Kañ la dox ci kaw ndox? Lu tax ñu bëgg koo rey? Kañ lay dellusi àddina? Dinga gis ay tont ci téere bii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dafa am ñeenti téere yu ay taalibey Yeesu Almasi bi bind ci ag dundam ak ay jàngaleem. Macë ab juutikat la woon jamono ji ko Yeesu woowee ngir mu nekk ab taalibeem (10.3). Téere bi mu bind, la mu ca jublu mooy mu won Yawut yi ne Yeesu mooy Almasi bi leen Yàlla digoon. Macë daldi tàmbali ci ni Yeesu askanoo te muy wone ne mooy sëtu Buur Daawuda te di sëtu Yonent Yàlla Ibraayma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Macë am na lu bare lu mu yégle ci nguurug Yàlla. Yeesu mi ngi waare naa: «Tuubleen seeni bàkkaar, ndax nguurug asamaan dëgmal na» (3.2). Nguuru Yàlla ci asamaan masu fee jóge, waaye dafa ñàkk ci àddina. Yàlla jox na sañ-sañ nit ngir mu yilif àddina. Waaye nit a tooñ Yàlla, gannaaw bi ko Seytaane naxee, ba nangu sañ-sañ bi. Kon nag Yàlla yónni na Almasi bi, ngir mu nanguwaat sañ-sañ bi. Gannaaw bi Yeesu dekkee, mu ne: «Joxees na ma bépp sañ-sañ fa asamaan ak fi kaw suuf» (28.17).</para>
  <para style="im">Ci tënk:</para>
  <para style="ili">1.1—4.25 Yeesu juddu na, tàmbali na liggéeyam.</para>
  <para style="ili">5.1—7.29 Yeesu mi ngi firi yoonu Yàlla wi.</para>
  <para style="ili">8.1—18.35 Yeesu day faj, di def ay kéemaan ak di jàngale.</para>
  <para style="ili">19.1—23.39 Yeesu day tukki Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="ili">24.1—25.46 Yeesu day jàngale ci mujug jamono ak delluseem.</para>
  <para style="ili">26.1—28.20 Yeesu dee na, dekki.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Cosaanu Yeesu Almasi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Lii mooy cosaanu Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, sëtub Ibraayma. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibraayma moo jur Isaaxa; Isaaxa jur <char style="w" lemma="Yanqóoba:">Yanqóoba</char>; Yanqóoba jur Yuda aki doomi baayam; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda moo jur Peres ak Sera, Tamar di seen ndey; Peres moo jur Esron, Esron jur góor gu ñuy wax Aram; <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram moo jur Aminadab; Aminadab jur Naason; Naason jur Salmon; <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon jur Bowas mi Raxab di ndeyam; Bowas moo jur Obedd mi Ruut di ndeyam; Obedd moo jur <char style="w" lemma="Yese:">Yese</char>, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese moo jur Buur Daawuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daawuda moo jur Suleymaan ma jabaru Uri ja woon, di ndeyam; <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Suleymaan moo jur Robowam; Robowam moo jur Abya; Abya moo jur Asaf<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Asaf </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Asa, kenn ki la.</char></note>; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asaf moo jur Yosafat; Yosafat moo jur Yoram, Yoram moo jur Osiyas; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Osiyas moo jur Yotam; Yotam moo jur Axas, Axas moo jur Esekiyas; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Esekiyas moo jur Manase; Manase moo jur Amon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Amon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Amos, kenn ki la.</char></note>; Amon jur Yosya; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosya moo jur Yekoña<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yekoña </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Yoyakin, kenn ki la.</char></note> aki doomi baayam ca jant ya ñu yóbboo Yawut ya ca jant ya ñu jàpp Yawut ya njaam, yóbbu <char style="w" lemma="Babilon:">Babilon</char>.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Gannaaw ba ñu leen gàddaayloo ñu dem Babilon la Yekoña jur Selcel; Selcel jur Sorobabel, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Sorobabel jur Abiyudd; Abiyudd jur Elyakim; Elyakim jur Asor; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asor jur Cadog; Cadog jur Akim; Akim jur Elyudd; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elyudd jur Elasar; Elasar jur Matan, Matan jur Yanqóoba; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yanqóoba nag moo jur Yuusufa jëkkëru Maryaama; te Maryaama moo jur Yeesu, mi ñuy wax Almasi bi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Mboolem maas yi dox diggante Ibraayma ba ca Daawuda nag di fukki maas ak ñeent; li dox diggante Daawuda ba ca njaam ga ca Babilon, di fukki maas ak ñeent; li dox diggante njaam ga ca Babilon ba ci Almasi bi, di fukki maas ak ñeent.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci juddub Yeesu Almasi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Juddub Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, nii la deme: Ndeyam Maryaama moo digoo woon ab séy ak Yuusufa. Laata ñuy ànd nag, gis nañu ne Maryaama dafa ëmb ci dogalu <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Ci biir loolu jëkkëram Yuusufa mi doon nit ku jub, naroon koo yiwi ci sutura, ndax bëggu ko woona weer. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Naka lay xalaat ci loolu, am malaakam Boroom bi feeñu ko ci gént, ne ko: «Yuusufa, sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, bul ragala yeggali sa jabar Maryaama, ndax doom ji sosu ci moom, ci Noo gu Sell gi la jóge. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Doom ju góor lay am; nanga ko tudde Yeesu (muy firi Boroom beey musle), ndax mooy musal aw xeetam ci seeni bàkkaar.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Loolu lépp a sotti ngir matal la Boroom bi waxe woon ca làmmiñu yonent ba, ba mu nee:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Janq bi mooy ëmb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">jur doom ju góor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">ñu tudde ko Emanuwel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 7.14.</note>,»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">muy firi Yàllaa ngi ak nun.<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ba Yuusufa yewwoo, la ko malaakam Boroom bi sant la def, daldi yeggali jabaram. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Waaye Yuusufa àndul ak moom, ba kera mu ame doom, muy góor, mu tudde ko Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Fóore ya seetsi nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu juddoo ca Betleyem gu diiwaanu Yude, yemook janti Buur <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char>, ndeke ay boroom xam-xam yu bàyyikoo penku dikk nañu Yerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Ñu ne: «Ana buur bi Yawut yi juddule? Biddiiwam lanu gis ca penku, moo tax nu dikk siyaaresi ko.»<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ba Buur Erodd déggee loolu, dafa jaaxle, mook mboolem waa Yerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ci kaw loolu mu woolu mboolem <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya, ak firikati yoonu Musaa ya. Mu daldi leen laaj fu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi wara juddoo. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ñu ne ko: «Xanaa Betleyem gu diiwaanu Yude, ndax noonu la ko yonent ba binde, ne:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Yaw Betleyem gu diiwaanu Yuda nag,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ñàkkoo solo moos ci dëkki Yuda yi gëna màgg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ndax ci yaw la njiit di soqikoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">di sàmm Israayil, sama ñoñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mise</char> 5.1; <char style="bk">2.Samiyel</char> 5.2.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ba loolu amee Erodd woolu boroom xam-xam ya ci kumpa, di leerlu bés ba biddiiw ba feqee. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Mu yebal leen nag Betleyem, ne leen: «Demleen seetal ma bu baax, mbirum xale bi. Bu ngeen ko gisee, xamal ma ko, ngir man itam ma siyaareji ko.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ñu déglu buur ba ba noppi, dem. Ci kaw loolu rekk biddiiw ba ñu gisoon ca penku ba, ne tëll jiite leen di dem, ba àgg, fa tiim béreb ba xale ba nekk, mu daldi taxaw. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ba ñu gisee biddiiw ba taxaw, bég nañu lool, mbég mu réya réy. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ñu dugg ca kër ga, gis xale bi ak ndeyam Maryaama. Ñu daldi ne gurub sukk, sujjóotal xale bi. Ba loolu amee ñu yebbi seenub denc, génne ca yóbbalu wurus ak cuuraay, ak ndàbb lu xeeñ lu ñuy wax miir.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Gannaaw loolu kàddu dikke leen ci gént, artu leen ngir ñu baña dellu ca Erodd. Ba mu ko defee ñu jaare weneen yoon, ñibbi seenum réew.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waa kër Yuusufa gàddaay nañu Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ba boroom xam-xam ya ñibbee, am malaakam Boroom bi moo jekki feeñu Yuusufa ci gént ne ko: «Jógal, ànd ak xale bi ak ndeyam te nga daw ba Misra, toog fa, ba kera ma di la jox ndigal, ndax <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char> dina seet xale bi, ngir sànk ko.»<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yuusufa jóg, ànd ak xale bi ak ndeyam, ag guddi, ngir làquji Misra. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Fa la toog, ba Erodd faatu. Noonu la mbir ma deme, ngir sottal la Boroom bi waxe woon ca làmmiñu yonent ba, ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:15">«Misra laa woowe sama doom, mu génne fa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Ose</char> 11.1.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ba Erodd gisee ne boroom xam-xam ya nax nañu ko, mer na mer mu réy lool, ba yeble, ngir reylu ci Betleyem ak la ko wër, mboolem xale yu góor yi am diggante ñaari at ak lu ko yées, muy diggante ba méngook àpp ba mu leerloo woon ca boroom xam-xam ya. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Booba la kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ci Yonent Yàlla Yeremi mate. Mooy ba mu nee:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Baat a nga jibe fa Raama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">ay jooy ak yuux yu metti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rasel mooy jooy ay doomam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">te bëggul kàddu gu ko dëfal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">nde doomam ya wuute<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yeremi</char> 31.15.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waa kër Yuusufa dellu nañu Israayil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Gannaaw ba <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char> faatoo, am malaakam Boroom bi moo jekki feeñu Yuusufa ci gént ca Misra, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ne ko: «Jógal ànd ak xale bi ak ndeyam te nga dellu Israayil. Ñi doon wuta jël bakkanu xale bi dee nañu.»<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yuusufa jóg, ànd ak xale bi ak ndeyam, daldi dellu réewum Israayil. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Teewul mu dégg ne Arkelawus moo falu buur ca Yude, wuutu baayam Erodd, ba tax mu ragal faa dem. Ci biir loolu kàddug artu dikkal ko ci gént, mu daldi walbatiku, làquji diiwaanu Galile. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Mu dikk nag ba dëkk ba ñuy wax Nasaret, sanc fa. Noonu la kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ca yonent ya, mate. Mooy ba ñu nee dees na ko woowe ab Nasareen.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yaxya waare na ngir nit ñi tuub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Jant yooyu la <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> feeñ, di waare ca màndiŋu Yude, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />naan: «Tuubleen seeni bàkkaar, ndax nguurug asamaan dëgmal na.» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Kooku lañu doon wax, te Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> jottali woon ko, ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Baatu nit a ngi xaacoo ca màndiŋ ma naan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Nangeen xàll yoonu Boroom bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">juballeen ay xàllam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 40.3.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yaxya nag mbubb mu ñu ràbbe kawaru giléem la daan sol, laxasoo laxasaayu der ca ndiggam, ab dundam diy njéeréer ak lemu àll. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Nit ña daldi bàbbeeku, jëm ca moom, waa Yerusalem, ak mboolem diiwaanu Yude, ak mboolem diiwaanu dexu Yurdan. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ñu tudd seeni bàkkaar, Yaxya sóob leen ca dexu Yurdan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ci kaw loolu ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ak ay <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> yu bare ñëw ci Yaxya, ngir mu sóob leen ci ndox. Yaxya ne leen: «Yeen njurum jaan mee, ku leen artu, ba ngeen di daw sànj miy dikk? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Kon nag jëfeleen jëf ju yelloo ag tuubeel, <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />te buleen defe ne man ngeena wax ci seenum xel ne: “Nun, Ibraayma mooy sunu maam,” ndax maa leen ko wax, doj yii, Yàlla man na cee sàkkal Ibraayma aw askan. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Léegi nag xàcc nañu sémmiñ ngir gor reenu garab yi ba noppi. Kon gépp garab gu ci meññul doom yu baax, dees koy gor, sànni ca sawara sa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Man, cim ndox laa leen di sóob, ngir jëmmal seenug tuubeel. Waaye kiy ñëw sama gannaaw moo ma sut, ba ay caraxam sax yeyoowuma ko koo summil. Moom nag ci <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi ak ci sawara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sóobu gi ci Noo gu Sell gi ak ci sawara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Almasi bi moo leen di sol doole ju bawoo ci Noo gu Sell gi, ak itam setal leen ni sawara di setale weñ gu am lu ko rax. Sawara dina taxawe itam céru mbugal mu ñeel ñi déggalul Yàlla. Seetal ci 12.49; </char><char style="bk">Jëf ya</char> 2.3.</note> la leen di sóob. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ab layoom a ngi ci loxoom, te mooy jéri dàggaam, ba mu set wecc; am peppam lay fat ci sàq mi, waaye xatax bi, da koy lakk ci sawara su dul fey mukk.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya sóob na Yeesu ci dexu Yurdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Booba la Yeesu jóge Galile, dikk ngir <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> sóob ko ca dexu Yurdan. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Teewul Yaxya gàntal, ne ko: «Man may ki soxla, nga sóob ma ci ndox, yaw nga dikk ci man!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yeesu ne ko: «Baalagum noonu rekk, ndax ci lanuy matale lépp li Yàlla bëgg ci njub.» Yaxya daldi koy nangul.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Gannaaw ba ñu sóobee Yeesu, ba mu génnee ca saa sa ca ndox ma, asamaan a jekki ubbiku ngir moom. Mu gis <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> wàcc ni am pitax ca kawam. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ci kaw loolu rekk, baat jibe asamaan, ne: «Kii mooy sama Doom, sama soppe; Moom laay bànneexoo.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu të na Seytaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ci kaw loolu <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> gi yóbbu Yeesu ba ca biir màndiŋ ma, ngir mu jànkoonte ak fiiri <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char>. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yeesu nekk na fa te lekkul ñeent fukki bëccëg ak ñeent fukki guddi. Gannaaw gi, mu xiif. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Fiirkat bi nag dikk ba ci moom, ne ko: «Ndegam yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, neel doj yii ñu soppaliku mburu.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Teewul Yeesu ne ko: «Bindees na ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">“Du aw ñam doŋŋ la nit di dunde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">waaye dees na dunde itam, gépp kàddu gu tukkee ci gémmiñug Yàlla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 8.3.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Ba loolu amee Seytaane yóbbu ko ca Yerusalem, dëkk bu sell ba, aj ko ca njobbaxtalu kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Mu ne ko: «Ndegam yaa di Doomu Yàlla, tëbal ci suuf, ndax bindees na ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Ay malaakaam lay jox ndigal ci sa mbir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">te seeni loxo lañu lay leewoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ba doo fakkastalu ciw doj<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 91.11-12.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yeesu ne ko: «Bindees na it, ne: “Bul seetlu Boroom bi sa Yàlla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 6.16.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Seytaane yóbbooti ko ba ca kaw tund wu kawe lool, won ko mboolem nguuri àddina yépp ak seeni daraja. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Mu ne ko: «Lii lépp, yaw laa koy may, soo sukkee sujjóotal ma.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Xiddi ma Seytaane, ndax bindees na ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">“Boroom bi sa Yàlla ngay sujjóotal, te moom doŋŋ ngay jaamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 6.13.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ba mu ko defee Seytaane won ko gannaaw, ay malaaka dikk, di toppatoo Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu door na liggéeyam ca Galile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yeesu nag dégg ne tëj nañu <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> kaso; mu daldi dem Galile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Gannaaw loolu, mu toxoo Nasaret, sanci Kapernawum ga féeteek dex ga, ca diiwaani Sabulon ak Neftali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />ngir matal kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ci Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char>, ba mu nee:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Yaw réewum Sabulon ak yaw réewum Neftali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">di yoonu géeju Galile, ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">yaw Galile, réew ma bare ñu dul yawut!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Askan wa nekkoon cig lëndëm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">gis na leer gu mag,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ña dëkke woon réewum dee mu ne këruus,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ñoom la leer fenkal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.15-16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 8.23; 9.1.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Jant yooyu la Yeesu tàmbali di waaraate naan: «Tuubleen seeni bàkkaar, ndax nguurug asamaan dëgmal na.»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu tànn na ñeenti taalibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yeesoo doon doxe ca tàkkal dexu Galile, daldi gis ñaar ñu bokk ndey ak baay, di Simoŋ mi ñuy wax Piyeer, ak Àndre rakkam. Ña ngay mbaal ca dex ga, ndax ay nappkat lañu woon. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñëwleen topp ma, ma def leen nappkati nit.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ca saa sa ñu won mbaal ya gannaaw, daldi topp ca moom.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Yeesu jóge fa, gis ñeneen ñaar ñu bokk ndey ak baay, Yanqóoba doomu Sebede, ak Yowaan mi Yanqóoba bokkal ndey ak baay. Ña nga ca gaal ga, ñook seen baay Sebede, di gaar seeni mbaal. Yeesu woo leen. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Ñu bàyyi gaal gaak seen baay ca saa sa, daldi topp ca moom.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu di wër Galile gépp, di jàngale ci seeni jàngu, di yégle xibaaru jàmm bu nguurug Yàlla, aka faj mboolem jàngoro yi, ak wéradiy nit ñi, <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />ba tax turam siiw, ba ca biir réewum Siri gépp. Ñu di ko indil mboolem ñi wopp, ak ñi ame mboolemi jàngoro aki mitit, ak ñi rab jàpp, ak ñiy say, ak lafañ yi, mu faj ñépp. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mbooloo mu bare nag topp ko, jóge ca wàlli Galile, ak diiwaan ba ñuy wax Fukki Dëkk, ak Yerusalem ak diiwaanu Yude, ba ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ñii la ndokkale ñeel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yeesu moo gisoon mbooloo ma, daldi yéeg ca tund wa. Naka la toog, taalibeem ya dikk. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Mu yékkati kàddoom, jàngal leen ne leen:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Ndokkalee ñi am xolub ku néew doole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">nde nguurug asamaan, ñooy boroom.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Ndokkalee ñiy jooy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">nde dees na leen dëfal.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Ndokkalee ñi woyof,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">nde ñooy moom àddina.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Ndokkalee ñi xiif aka mar jëfe njekk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">ndax dinañu regg.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Ndokkalee ñi am yërmande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">nde dees na leen yërëm.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Ndokkalee ñi sell ab xol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">nde ñooy gis Yàlla.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Ndokkalee ñiy sàkku jàmm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">nde ñoom lees di woowe doomi Yàlla.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Ndokkalee ñi seenug njub tax ñu di leen bunduxataal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">nde nguurug asamaan ñooy boroom.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />«Ndokkalee yeen, bu ñu leen di saaga, di leen bunduxataal, di leen sosal gépp njombe ndax man. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Bégleen te bànneexu, ndax seen yoolub ëllëg bu réy, nde noonu lañu daan fitnaale yonent yi fi jiitu.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xorom ak leer ñooy misaali gëmkat ñi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Yeena di xoromas àddina. Bu xorom raxee ba sàlli, nees koy delloo cafkaam? Du jariñati dara, xanaa ñu sànni ko ci biti, nit ñi dox ci kawam. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Yeena di leeru àddina. Ab dëkk, bu nekkee ci kaw tund, du mana làqu. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Te it deesul taal ab làmp, dëpp cig leget, waaye dees koy aj ca kaw tegoom, ba muy leeral ñi nekk ci néeg bi ñépp. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Yeen, na seenug leer leere noonu ci kanam nit ñi, ngir ñu gis seen jëf ju rafet, ba sàbbaal seen Baay ba fa kaw.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonu Musaa ak kàdduy waxyu ci Yeesu la mate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Buleen defe ne damaa dikk ngir tebbi yoonu Musaa, ak waxi yonent yi. Tebbisiwuma, damaa sottalsi. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Maa leen ko wax déy, ba keroog asamaan ak suuf raaf, wenn rëdd, mbaa genn maaska du raaf mukk ci yoonu Musaa, ba kera lépp sotti. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Kon képp ku wàcc lenn ci ndigal yii gëna tuut, te di ko diglee noonu, ki gëna tuut lees lay woowe fa nguurug asamaan. Waaye képp ku koy jëfe, di ko digle, ku mag ki lees lay woowe fa nguurug asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Te kat maa leen ko wax, bu seenub njub ëppul njubu firikati yoonu Musaa yi ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yi, dungeen tàbbi mukk ci nguurug asamaan.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mere nit ki mooy bóom ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Dégg ngeen ne waxoon nañu maam ya ne leen: “Bul bóom; ku bóom yoon dina la daan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.13; <char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 5.17.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Waaye man maa leen ko wax, képp ku mere sa mbokk, dees na la àtte. Ku ne sa mbokk: “Doo dara,” <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekat</char> ya am na ci yaw yoon, te ku ne sa moroom “Dof bi,” sawara am na ci yaw yoon. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Kon soo yóbboo sa sarax ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaay</char> ba, ba fàttaliku foofa ne, am na lu la sa mbokk meree, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />dangay bàyyi sab sarax ca kanam sarxalukaay ba, te nga njëkka jubooji ak sa mbokk ma, doora dellu, joxe sab sarax.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«Gaawala juboo ak sab jotewaale, bi ngay ànd ak moom jëm ca ëttu àttekaay ba; lu ko moy sab jotewaale jébbal la àttekat ba, kooka jox la alkaati ba, mu ne la ràpp tëj. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Maa la ko wax déy, doo fa génne mukk te feyuloo lépp ba ci dërëm bi gëna tuut.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku xemmem jigéen, njaaloo nga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Dégg ngeen ñu ne: “Bul njaaloo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.14.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Waaye man maa leen wax ne képp ku xool jigéen, ngir xemmem ko, njaaloo nga ak moom xaat ci sam xel. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Bu la sa bëtu ndijoor dee bàkkaarloo, luqil, sànni, ndax ñàkk sa benn cér moo gën ci yaw ñu sànni sa yaram wépp sawara. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Bu la sa loxol ndijoor dee bàkkaarloo, daggal, sànni, ndax ñàkk sa benn cér moo gën ci yaw, sa yaram wépp tàbbi sawara.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Njaaloo doŋŋ moo daganal pase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Te waxees na ne: “Képp ku fase sa jabar, nanga ko jox kayitu pase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 24.1.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Waaye man maa leen wax ne képp ku fase sa jabar, te njaaloo taxul, yaa ko njaalooloo. Te ku ñu fase it, képp ku ko takk, njaaloo nga.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bul xàcc sa ngiñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Déggati ngeen ñu ne waxoon nañu maam ya ne leen: “Bul xàcc sa ngiñ, waaye wàccool ak Boroom bi sa kàdduy ngiñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 23.22-24.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Waaye man maa leen wax ne leen, buleen giñ dara; bumu di ci asamaan, nde asamaan moo di jalub Yàlla; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />bumu di ci suuf, nde suuf moo di ndëggastalam; bumu di ci Yerusalem, nde Yerusalem moo di dëkku Buur bu mag bi. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Bul giñ it ci sa kaaŋum bopp, ndax du sa genn kawar goo mana weexal, mbaa nga ñuulal ko. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Na sa kàddu di waaw, soo waree ne waaw; mbaa déet, soo waree ne déet. Leneen lu ci tegu, ci <char style="w" lemma="ku bon ki:">ku bon ki</char> la jóge.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bul feyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Dégg ngeen ñu ne: “Bët, bët a koy fey; bëñ, bëñ a koy fey<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 21.24.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Waaye man maa leen wax ne leen, buleen jànkoonte ak ku bon, waaye ku leen dóor mbejum lexu ndijoor, dékkleen ko lex ba ca des. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ku leen nara yóbbu ci yoon, ngir jël seenub turki, baleen kook seen mbubb mu mag, dolli ko. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ku leen ga, ngeen yenul ko ci doxub benn kilomet, àndleen ak moom ñaar. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ku leen ñaan, mayleen ko, te ku leen leb, buleen ko gàntu.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Dégg ngeen ñu ne: “Soppleen seen moroom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 19.18.</note>” te bañ seenub noon. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Waaye man maa leen wax ne leen, soppleen seeni noon te ñaanal ñi leen di bunduxataal, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ngir ngeen doon doomi seen Baay ba fa asamaan, nde mooy kiy fenkal jantam ci kaw ñu bon ñi, ak ñu baax ñi, te mooy tawal ñi jub, ak ñi jubadi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Su ngeen soppee ñi leen sopp, ban yool ngeen am? Xanaa du <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> yi sax noonu lañuy jëfe? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Su ngeen dee saafoonte ak seeni bokk doŋŋ, ana lu ngeen def lu yéeme? Xanaa du yéefar yi sax noonu lañuy jëfe? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ni seen Baay ba fa asamaan mate nag, nangeen ni mate.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Buleen sarxe ngir ngistal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Wattuleena def seenu njekk ci kanam nit ñi, ngir ngistal. Lu ko moy, dungeen ame yool fa seen Baay ba fa asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Kon nag booy sarxe, bul ko yéglee coowal liit, ni ko jinigalkat yiy defe ci jàngu yi ak mbedd yi, ngir nit ñi kañ leen. Maa leen ko wax déy, ñooñu jot nañu seen yool bu mat sëkk. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Waaye booy sarxe, li sa loxol ndijoor di def, bu ko sa loxol càmmoñ xam, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />su ko defee sa sarax di kumpa, te sa Baay biy gis ci biir kumpa moo lay yool.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buleen ñaan ngir ngistal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Bu ngeen di ñaan, buleen mel ni jinigalkat yi safoo taxaw di ñaan ci jàngu yi ak selebe yoon yi, ngir fés. Maa leen ko wax déy, ñooñu jot nañu seen yool bu mat sëkk. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Yaw nag booy ñaan, duggal sa néegu biir, tëj sa bunt, te nga ñaan sa Baay ci kumpa. Sa Baay biy gis ci biir kumpa moo lay yool.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />«Bu ngeen di ñaan, buleen jàppoo kebetu ni yéefar yi foog ne ci wax ju bare lees leen di nangule. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Kon buleen mel ni ñoom, ndax seen Baay xam na li ngeen soxla bala ngeen ko koo ñaan. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Yeen nag nangeen ñaane nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Sunu Baay bi fi asamaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">nañu wormaal sa sellaayu tur,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />na sa nguur dikk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">na sa coobare ame fi suuf na mu ame fa asamaan.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />May nu bésub tey, sunu dundub bés bu nekk,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />te nga baal nu sunuy tooñ, ni nu baale nun itam, ñi nu tooñ.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Bu nu dugal ci nattu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">waaye yal nanga nu musal ci <char style="w" lemma="ku bon ki:">ku bon ki</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">Yaw de yaa yelloo nguur ak kàttan ak màggaay, ba fàww. Amiin.”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Su ngeen baalee nit ñi seeni tooñ, seen Baay ba fa asamaan dina leen baal, yeen itam. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Waaye su ngeen baalewul, seen Baay it du leen baal seeni tooñ.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buleen woor ngir ngistal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Su ngeen di woor, buleen yoggoorlu ni jinigalkat yi. Dañuy ñaawal seen kanam, ngir wone ne dañoo woor. Maa leen ko wax déy, ñooñu jot nañu seen yool bu mat sëkk. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Yaw nag booy woor, xeeñlul te sëlmu ba set, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ngir baña won nit ñi sa koor, ba mu des sa Baay bi teew ci kumpa. Sa Baay biy gis ci biir kumpa moo lay yool.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alal fa Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Buleen dajale ab denc ci kaw suuf, fi ko max ak xomaag di yàqe, mbaa ab sàcc bëtt, jël ko. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Waaye dajaleleen ab denc fa asamaan, fa ko max ak xomaag dul yàqe, te ab sàcc du bëtt, jël ko. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ndaxte fa sab denc nekk, sab xol it a nga fa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Bët mooy làmpu yaram. Su sa bët wéree, sa yaram wépp a ciy leerloo, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />waaye bu sa bët bonee, sa yaram wépp a ngi ci lëndëm. Leer gi ci yaw nag, su dee ag lëndëm, ndaw lëndëm gu réy!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Kenn manula jaamu ñaari sang; dangay dëddu kii, sopp kee, mbaa nga fonk kii, cof kee. Manuleena jaamoondoo Yàlla ak Alal.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wóoluleen Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Moo tax ma ne leen, buleen seen bakkan jaaxal, ngir lu ngeen lekk, mbaa lu ngeen naan, te it buleen seen yaram jaaxal ngir lu ngeen sol. Xanaa du lekk gi, bakkan bee ko ëpp solo, te koddaay li it, yaram wee ko ëpp solo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Xoolleen picc yi: duñu ji, duñu góob, duñu denc ci am sàq. Teewul seen Baay ba fa asamaan di leen dundal. Yeen nag, xanaa du yeena gën picc yi fuuf? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ana kan ci yeen mooy jaaxle, di xalaat a xalaat bakkanam, ba mana yokk ci àppam, lu tollook xef ak xippi?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />«Koddaay nag, ana lu ngeen ciy jaaxle? Seetaatleen ni tóor-tóor yiy saxe ci tool yi. Doñ-doñiwuñu, ëccuñu, <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />waaye maa leen wax ne Suleymaan ak darajaam jépp sax, soluwul woon ni benn ci ñoom. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ndegam ñaxum tool miy dund tey, te léegi ñu sànni ko cib taal, moom la Yàlla di wodde nii kay, xanaa astamaak yeen? Yeenaka néew ngëm! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Kon nag, buleen jaaxle, naan: “Lu nuy lekk?” mbaa “Lu nuy naan?” mbaa “Lu nuy sol?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ndaxte loolu lépp, yéefar yi ñoo koy tiisoo. Te seen Baay ba fa asamaan xam na ne soxla ngeen loolu lépp. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Waaye njëkkleena tiisoo nguurug Yàlla, ak njub gi mu laaj, te loolu lépp moo leen ko ciy dollil. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Kon nag buleen am xalaat ci ëllëg, ndax ëllëg dina xalaat boppam. Bés bu nekk, ab coonoom doy na ko.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Sikkal jàmbur aay na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Buleen di sikkale, su ko defee deesuleen sikkal. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ndaxte àtte bi ngeen di àttee, moom lees leen di àttee; te natt bi ngeen di nattale, moom lees leen di nattale. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ana looy xoole xatax bi ci sa bëtu mbokk, te sa bët bi, gànj gi ci nekk, gisuloo ko? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Mbaa ana noo naa sa mbokk: “Xaaral, ma dindil la xatax bi ci sa bët,” te gànj a ngoogu ci sa bët yaw? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Jinigalkat bi, njëkkala dindi gànj gi ci sa bët, ba gis bu baax, nga doora dindi xatax bi ci sa bëtu mbokk.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Buleen jox lu sell xaj yi, mbaa ngeen di sànni seeni per ci kanam mbaam-xuux yi, lu ko moy ñu dëggaate ko, ba noppi xaj yi walbatiku ci seen kaw, daggate leen.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yàlla nangu na ñaanu ku gëm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Ñaanleen, ñu may leen; seetleen, gis; fëggleen, ñu ubbil leen. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ndaxte képp ku ñaan, dinga am; ku seet, gis; ku fëgg it, dees na la ubbil. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Kan ci yeen sax, la doomam di ñaan mburu, mu jox kow doj? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Mbaa mu ñaan kow jën, mu jox ko jaan? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ndegam yeen ñi bon, yeena mana may seeni gone lu baax nag, kon seen Baay ba fa asamaan, ñaata yoon la leen dàqa may lu baax, ñi ko ko ñaan!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Lépp lu ngeen bëgg nit ñi defal leen ko nag, nangeen leen ko defale noonu, nde loolu mooy yoonu Musaa ak yonent yi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buntu dund xat na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Duggeleen ci bunt bu xat bi, ndax bunt beek yoon wi jëm sànkute dañoo yaatu, te ñu baree cay dugge. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Waaye xat la def, bunt ba jëm dund; sew it la yoon wa def, te ñu néew a koy gis.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doomu garab, ndey ja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Moytuleen yonenti caaxaan yi. Ñooy ñëw ci yeen, soloo melow xar, te diy bukki yu soxor. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Seenum meññeef ngeen leen di xàmmee. Ndax ag dédd, dees na ci witte doomi reseñ; am ay dagg, dees na ci witte doomi figg? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Garab gu baax gu nekk, doom yu baax lay meññ; waaye garab gu bon, doom yu bon lay meññ. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Garab gu baax daal manula meññ doom yu bon, garab gu bon itam manula meññ doom yu baax. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Gépp garab gu dul meññ doom yu baax nag, dees koy gor, sànni ca sawara sa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Kon nag ñoom daal ci seenum meññeef ngeen leen di xàmmee.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Du képp ku ma naan: “Sang bi, Sang bi,” mooy tàbbi ci nguurug asamaan, xanaa ñiy jëfe sama coobarey Baay ba fa asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Bu bés baa, ñu baree ma naan: “Sang bi, Sang bi, xanaa du saw tur lanu daa waaree, di dàqe saw tur ay rab, tey defe saw tur kéemaan yu bare?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Booba laa leen di wax ne: “Masuma leena xam, defkati ndëngte yi ngeen doon, xiddileen ma!”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ki dégg, jëfe, moo xelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Kon képp ku dégg sama kàddu yii, te di ko jëfe, dafa mel ni nit ku xelu ki tabax këram ci kaw aw doj. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ba mu noppee, taw ba sóob, wal ma dikk, ngelaw la riddi, lépp dal ca kër ga, te màbbul, ndax doj wa mu sampe. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Waaye képp ku dégg sama kàddu yii te jëfewu ko, dafa mel ni nit ku ñàkk xel ki tabax këram ci gannuus gi. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ba mu noppee, taw ba sóob, wal ma dikk, ngelaw la riddi, lépp dal ca kër ga; mu màbb, yàqu yaxeet.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ba Yeesu waxee loolu ba noppi, mbooloo ma daa yéemu ca njàngaleem, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />ndax sañ-sañ ba mu leen di jàngale niroowul ak na seen firikati yoonu Musaa yay jàngalee.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ku gaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yeesu moo wàcce ca tund wa, mbooloo mu bare topp ko. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ab <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> jekki dikk, sujjóotal ko, ne ko: «Sang bi, su la soobee, man nga maa setal.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Mu tàllal loxoom, laal ko ne: «Soob na ma, setal.» Ca saa sa <char style="w" lemma="ngaana g-:">ngaanaam</char> ga set wecc. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yeesu ne ko: «Fexeel ba bu ko wax kenn, demal rekk ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ba, ngir mu seet la, te nga génne sarax si yoonu Musaa santaane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 14.1-32.</note>, ngir muy firnde ci ñoom.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngëm gu réy, yool bu réy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu duggsee dëkk ba ñuy wax Kapernawum, ab <char style="w" lemma="njiitu takk-der b-:">njiitu takk-der</char> bu waa Room moo dikk ba ci moom, ñaan ko, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />ne ko: «Sang bi, sama surga moo tëdd ca kër ga, lafañ, te nekke mitit wu tar.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man, maay dikk, faj ko.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Teewul njiit la ne ko: «Sang bi, yeyoowuma nga dugg sama kër; waxal genn kàddu rekk, sama surga wér. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ndaxte man itam ci kilifteef laa tënku, te maa ngeek ay takk-der yu nekk ci sama ndigal. Su ma nee kii: “Demal,” mu dem, ma ne kee: “Ñëwal,” mu ñëw. Te sama jaam bu ma ko nee: “Defal lii,” mu def ko.»<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ba ko Yeesu déggee, daa yéemu, daldi ne ñi topp ci moom: «Maa leen ko wax, déy, ku réye nii ngëm, gisuma ko ci <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char>. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Maa leen wax ne leen, ñu bareey bawoo penku ak sowu, dikk bokk ca ndabal bernde ja, ñook Ibraayma ak Isaaxa ak <char style="w" lemma="Yanqóoba:">Yanqóoba</char>, keroog ca nguurug asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Waaye doom yi yeyoo nguur ga, ñoom lees di sànni ca biti ca lëndëm gu tar ga. Foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu ne njiitu takk-der ba: «Demal, noonu nga ko gëme, na ame noonu ci yaw.» Ca waxtu woowa la surga ba wér.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na jarag yu bare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu dem kër Piyeer, daldi fekk yaayu jabaru Piyeer, mu tëdd, yaram wa tàng. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yeesu jàpp loxol soxna sa, tàngooru yaram wa teqalikook moom, soxna sa jóg, di ko toppatoo.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Ca ngoon sa ñu indil ko ñu bare ñu rab jàpp. Ba loolu amee Yeesu dàqe rab ya kàddoom, mboolem ña wopp, mu faj leen. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Noonu la kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ci gémmiñu Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> mate. Mooy ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">«Moom sunuy wopp la jël,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">sunuy jàngoro la sëfoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 53.4.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ba Yeesu gisee mbooloo ma ko wër nag, dafa sant taalibe ya, ñu jàll ba ca wàllaa dex ga. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ci biir loolu ab firikatu yoonu Musaa dikk, ne ko: «Kilifa gi, yaw laay topp fépp foo jëm.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yeesu itam ne ko: «Till akug kàmbam, njanaaw akub tàggam, waaye <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki de, amul fu mu wéer boppam.» <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ba loolu amee keneen ca taalibe ya ne ko: «Sang bi, may ma, ma njëkka dem robi sama baay.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yeesu ne ko: «Toppal ci man te nga bàyyi néew yi, ñu rob seeni néew.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dalal na ngelaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ba mu ko defee, Yeesu dugg ca gaal ga, ay taalibeem ànd ak moom. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ca saa sa ngelaw lu réy yëngal dex ga, ba gannax ya mëdd gaal ga. Teewul Yeesoo ngay nelaw. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Taalibe ya jegesi, yee ko, ne: «Sang bi, wallu nu, nu ngi sànku!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Lu ngeen di tiit, yeenaka néew ngëm!» Ci kaw loolu mu jóg, daldi gëdd ngelaw la ak gannax ya. Lépp ne sendaw. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ba loolu amee, ñu waaru, naan: «Kii moo di kan, ba ngelaw leek dex gi di ko déggal?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ñaar ñu rab jàpp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ba Yeesu jàllee, ba teere diiwaanu waa Gadara, ñaar ñu rab jàpp ñoo génne ca sëg ya, dikk dogale ko, te di ñu soxor lool, ba kenn ñemewul woona jaare foofa. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ñu jekki xaacu, ne: «Yaw <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> ji, ana lu nu joteek yaw? Ndax danga fee ñëw ngir mbugal nu, te jotagul?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Fekk na genn coggalu mbaam-xuux yu baree nga leen dànd lu sore, di for. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Rab ya tinu ko ne: «Boo nu dàqee, yebal nu ca coggalu mbaam-xuux ya.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yeesu ne leen: «Demleen.» Rab ya nag génn, dugg ca mbaam-xuux ya, ci saa si coggal gépp bartaloondoo, tàbbi ca dex ga, daldi lab.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ba loolu amee sàmm ya daw, ba ca dëkk ba, nettaliji lépp, ak la xewoon ca ña rab jàpp. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Ci kaw loolu rekk dëkk ba bépp génn, ngir dajeek Yeesu. Naka lañu ko gis, daldi koy tinu ngir mu génn seen gox ba.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ab lafañ ca Kapernawum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu dugg gaal, jàll dex ga, daldi dellu dëkkam. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ñu jekki indil ko ab lafañ, mu tëdd cig laltu. Ba Yeesu seetloo seen ngëm, da ne lafañ ba: «Na sa xel dal, doom, jéggalees na la say bàkkaar.»<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ay firikati yoonu Musaa nag jekki di wax ci seen biir naan: «Kii, Yàlla lay diir mbagg!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Teewul Yeesu xam seen xalaat, ne leen: «Lu waral yii xalaat yu bon ci seen xel? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ana ci yii yaar, lu ci gëna yomb: ne “Jéggalees na la say bàkkaar,” am ne: “Jógal te dox”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Kon nag dingeen xam ne <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki am na ci kaw suuf, sañ-sañu jéggale ay bàkkaar.» Mu ne lafañ ba: «Jógal, jël sag laltu, te ñibbi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Lafañ ba jóg, daldi ñibbi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ba mbooloo ma gisee loolu, dañoo tiit, di sàbbaal Yàlla, mi may nit ñi boobu sañ-sañ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu woo na Macë</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yeesu bàyyikoo ca, daldi gis waa ju ñuy wax Macë, mu toog ca juuti ba. Mu ne ko: «Kaay, topp ma.» Mu jóg, topp ko.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Gannaaw ga, Yeesu doon lekk ca kër Macë, lu bare ci ay <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> aki bàkkaarkat jekki dikk, ñu bokk di lekk, ñook Yeesu aki taalibeem. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" /><char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya nag gis loolu, ne taalibe ya: «Juutikat yeek bàkkaarkat yi la seen kilifa di bokkal lekk nag?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yeesu nag dégg ca, ne leen: «Du ñi wér ñoo soxla fajkat, ñi wéradi ñoo ko soxla. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Demleen jàngi lu kàddu gii di firi: “Ngor laa namm, dub sarax<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Ose</char> 6.6.</note>,” ndax du ñi jub laa woosi, bàkkaarkat yi laay woo.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koor am na bésam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Gannaaw loolu taalibey <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> dikk ca Yeesu ne ko: «Lu tax nun ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yi, nuy woor, te say taalibe duñu woor?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ndax xariti séet dinañu naqarlu dara, li feek boroom séet baa ngi teew ci seen biir? Teewul jamonoo ngi ñëw, dees na jële boroom séet bi ci seen biir; su boobaa nag dinañu woor. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Kenn du jël sekkit wu yees, di ko daaxe mbubb mu ràpp, ndax sekkit wi day ñoddi mbubb mi, mu gëna xar. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Te it deesul def biiñ bu bees ci mbuusi der yu ràpp. Lu ko moy, mbuus yi fàcc, biiñ bi tuuru, mbuus yi yàqu. Biiñ bu bees daal, ci mbuus mu bees lees koy def, ñaar ñépp mucc.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dekkal na, faj na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Naka la leen Yeesu di wax loolu rekk, ab njiit dikk, sujjóotal ko, ne ko: «Sama doom ju jigéen moo faatu léegi, waaye ngalla dikkal, <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg ko sa loxo</char>, mu dund.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yeesu jóg, topp ko, mooki taalibeem.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ndeke sennas ndaw a nga ca ànd. Diiru fukki at ak ñaar ma ngay xëpp deret. Mu doxe gannaaw, daldi teg loxoom ca catu mbubbam. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Fekk na mu naan ci xelam: «Su ma manoona laal catu mbubbam rekk, dinaa wér.»<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yeesu ne gees, gis ko, ne ko: «Janq, na sam xel dal, sa ngëm a la faj.» Ca waxtu woowa la ndaw sa wér.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu agsi ca kër njiit la, daldi gis toxorokati dëj ya, ak kër-këru mbooloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Mu ne leen: «Génnleen, janq bi deewul, day nelaw rekk.» Nit ña nag di ko ñaawal. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Gannaaw ba ñu génnee mbooloo ma, Yeesu dugg, jàpp ca loxol janq ba, mu daldi jóg. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ba loolu amee coow loola law ca réew ma mépp.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ñaari gumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ba Yeesu jógee foofa, ñaari silmaxaa ko topp, di xaacu, naan: «Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, yërëm nu!» <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Naka la Yeesu délsi, ba dugg ca kër ga, gumba ya duggsi. Yeesu ne leen: «Ndax gëm ngeen ne man naa koo def?» Ñu ne ko: «Waawaaw, Sang bi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yeesu daldi laal seeni bët, ne leen: «Noonu ngeen ko gëme, na ame noonu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ca saa sa seeni bët ubbiku. Yeesu nag artu leen bu baax, ne leen: «Moytuleen kenn xam ko.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Teewul ñu génn rekk, di waxtaane Yeesu ca gox ba bépp.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na boroom rab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Naka lañuy dem, ñu jekki indil ko ab luu bu rab jàpp. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yeesu daldi dàq rab wa, luu ba wax, mbooloo ma waaru, naan: «Guléet lu mel nii feeñ ci Israayil.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Teewul <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya naan: «Ci buuru rab yi lay dàqe ay rab.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu yërëm na mbooloo mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu di wër mboolem dëkk yu mag yaak yu ndaw ya, di leen jàngal ci seeni jàngu, di yégle xibaaru jàmm bu nguurug Yàlla, tey faj mboolem jàngoro, ak mboolem wéradi.<verse eid="MAT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ba Yeesu gisee mbooloo ya, da leena ñeewante, ndax na ñu sonne, ne yàcc, mbete xar yu amul sàmm. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Mu daldi ne taalibeem ya: «Ngóob mee yaatu, te surga yi néew. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Kon nag ñaanleen Boroom ngóob mi, mu yebal ay surga cim ngóobam.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu yebal na fukki ndaw ya ak ñaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu woo fukki taalibeem ya ak ñaar, daldi leen jox sañ-sañu faj jàngoro yépp ak wéradi yépp, ak di dàq ay <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char>.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Fukki ndaw yaak ñaar nag, seeni tur a ngii:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">ki jiitu mooy Simoŋ mi ñuy wax Piyeer,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">ak Àndre mi bokk ak moom ndey ak baay,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">ak Yanqóoba doomu Sebede, ak Yowaan rakkam,<verse eid="MAT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />ak Filib ak Bartelemi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">ak Tomaa ak Macë, <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> ba woon,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">ak Yanqóoba doomu Alfe, ak Tade,<verse eid="MAT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />ak Simoŋ, Mbokki kuréelu Moom-sa-réew ma,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:4">ak Yuda Iskaryo, may mujj wor Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Fukk ak ñaar ñooñu la Yeesu yebal, jox leen ndigal, ne leen: «Buleen dem ci ñi dul Yawut, buleen dem ci benn dëkku waa <char style="w" lemma="Samari:">Samari</char>. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ña ngeen di dem ca ñoom kay ñoo di xari kër Israayil yi réer. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Demleen tey yégle ne: “Nguurug asamaan dëgmal na.” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Ñi wopp, fajleen leen; ñi dee, dekkalleen leen; <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> yi, setalleen leen; rab yi, ngeen dàq leen. Yeena jot ay xéewal ci dara, kon joxeleen ci dara. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Buleen yóbbu wurus mbaa xaalis mbaa xànjar bu ngeen di fas ci seen geño, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />mbaa mbuus mu ngeen di tukkee, mbaa ñaari turki, mbaa yeneen carax, mbaa aw yet, ndax ku ñaq, jariñu.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Bépp dëkk bu mag mbaa bu ndaw bu ngeen dugg, laajteleen ba xam ku ca yell, ngeen dal ca moom, ba kera ngeen dem. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Bu ngeen duggee ci kër nag, nuyooleen. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Su ko kër ga yeyoo, seen jàmm wàcc ca ñoom. Lu ko moy, seen jàmm délsi ci yeen. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Fu ñu leen dalalewul, mbaa ñu tanqamlu fa seeni wax, génnleen kër ga mbaa dëkk ba, te ngeen faxas seen pëndub tànk. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Maa leen ko wax déy, keroog bés-pénc, dëkk boobu, waa réewum <char style="w" lemma="Sodom ak Gomor:">Sodom ak Gomor</char> ñoo koy gënu demin.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Maa ngii di leen yebal, mbete ay xar ci biiri bukki. Muusleen nag niy jaan, te lewet niy pitax. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Waaye moytuleen nit ñi, ndax dees na leen jàpp, jébbal leen pénci layoo ya, te dees na leen caw ay yar ca seeni jàngu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Dees na leen yóbbu ngir man ci kanam boroomi dëkk, aki buur, ngir ngeen yékkati kàdduy seede, ñeel leen, ñoom ak ñi dul Yawut. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Bu ñu leen tegee loxo nag, buleen jaaxle ci nu ngeen di waxe, ak lu ngeen di wax, ndax dees na leen xamal ca waxtu wa, la ngeen di wax; <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />ndax du yeenay wax, waaye <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug</char> seen Baay mooy wax ci yeen.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />«Doomu ndey dina wor doomu ndey, ngir ñu rey ko, baay it wore noonu doomam, te doom dina jógal waajuram, ba reylu ko. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Te it ñépp a leen di bañ ndax sama tur; waaye ku muñ ba muj ga, kooku dina mucc. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Buñu leen bunduxataalee ci dëkk bii, dawleen ca bee. Maa leen ko wax déy, dungeen wër ba dajal dëkki Israayil yépp, te <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki dikkul.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Taalibe sutul kilifaam, te jaam sutul sangam. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ab taalibe, su demee ba mel ni kilifaam, wàcc na; ab jaam it, su demee ba mel ni sangam, wàcc na. Ndegam boroom kër gi lañuy woowe Beelsebul, miy Seytaane, astamaak waa këram. <verse eid="MAT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Kon nag buleen leen ragal, nde mboolem lu làqu, dees na ko feeñal, te lu umpe, dees na ko xam. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Li ma leen wax ci biir lëndëm, waxleen ko bëccëg ndarakàmm; li ñu leen déey, biralleen ko ci kawi taax. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Te buleen ragal ñiy rey aw yaram, te manuñoo rey jëmmu biir, waaye ragalleen ki mana boole jëmmu biir ak aw yaram, sànk ca biir sawara. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ñaari picci ramatu, xanaa du dërëm lay jar? Moona menn ci ñoom du daanu ci suuf te soobul seen Baay. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Seen kawari bopp sax, waññees na lépp. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Kon nag buleen ragal dara, nde ndiiraanu ramatu, yeena ko gën.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Képp ku dëggal fi kanam nit ñi, ne man nga féeteel, man ci sama wàllu bopp itam, dinaa dëggal fa sama kanam Baay ba fa asamaan, ne man nga féeteel. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Waaye képp ku weddi fi kanam nit ñi, ne man nga féeteel, man ci sama wàllu bopp itam dinaa weddi fa sama kanam Baay ba fa asamaan, ne man nga féeteel.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Te it buleen defe ne wàcce jàmm ci kaw suuf moo ma indi; du jàmm, waaye jaasi moo ma indi. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ndaxte li ma indi moo di teqale doom ju góor ak baayam; ak doom ju jigéen ak ndeyam; ak jabar ak goroom. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Te it nooni nit ki, waa këram lay doon. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Ku ma gënalul sa ndey mbaa sa baay, yeyoowuloo ma; ku ma gënalul sa doom ju góor mbaa ju jigéen, yeyoowuloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Ku jëlul sa bantu bopp bu ñu lay daaj, te topp ci man, yeyoowuloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Képp ku jot sa bakkan, dinga ko ñàkk, te ku ñàkk sa bakkan ndax man, dinga ko jotaat.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Képp ku leen dalal nag, man nga dalal, te ku ma dalal, dalal nga ki ma yebal. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ku dalal ab yonent ndax turu yonentam, ci peyug yonent ngay ame yool; te ku dalal aji jub ndaxug njubteem, peyug aji jub ngay ame yool. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Te maa leen ko wax déy, kenn ci ñii gëna tuut, képp ku ko may ab kaasu ndox mu sedd doŋŋ, ndax da di sama taalibe, doo ñàkk sag pey mukk.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ba Yeesu joxee ndigal yooyu, fukki taalibeem ya ak ñaar ba noppi, da faa bàyyikoo, ngir jàngaleji aka waare ca seen dëkki gox ba.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya yónnee na ca Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Gannaaw loolu <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> moo dégge ca kaso ba, jëfi <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi. Mu yónni nag ci moom ay taalibeem, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />ne ko: «Ndax yaw yaa di Ki wara ñëw, am keneen lanuy séentu?»<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yeesu ne leen: «Li ngeen dégg te gis ko, demleen àgge ko Yaxya. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Silmaxa yaa ngiy gis, lafañ yi di dox, <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> yiy wér, tëx yiy dégg, néew yiy dekki, néew-doole yiy dégg xibaaru jàmm bi. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ku xàccul sa péeteek man nag, ndokkalee yaw.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ba taalibey Yaxya demee, Yeesu daldi wax ak mbooloo ma ci mbirum Yaxya, ne leen: «Lu ngeen seetaani woon ca màndiŋ ma? Xanaa barax bu ngelaw liy yëngal? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Kon lu ngeen seetaani woon? Boroom yére yu rafet? Waaye boroom yére yu rafet yi, ci këri buur lañu dëkk! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Kon nag lu ngeen seetaani woon? Ab yonent? Waawaaw, maa leen ko wax, te wees na ab yonent sax. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ci moom moomu lañu bindoon ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“Maa ngii di yebal sama ndaw, mu jiitu la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">xàllal la saw yoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Malasi</char> 3.1.</note>.”<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Maa leen ko wax déy, li jigéen jur, ku sut Yaxya masu cee feeñ. Waaye ki gëna tuut ci nguurug asamaan a ko sut. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ca jamonoy Yaxya ba léegi, nguurug asamaan mu ngi jànkoonteek coono, ñiy jëfe doole di ko jéema aakimoo. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ndaxte mboolem yonent yi, ak yoonu Musaa wax nañu, ba kera Yaxya di feeñ. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Te Yaxya moomu, ndegam man ngeena jàpp li may wax, mooy <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> mi waroona délsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Malasi</char> 3.23.</note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Ku ami nopp nag, na dégg.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«Ana ku may niruleek niti tey jii? Ñu ngi nirook xale yu toog ca pénc ma, di awoonte, naan:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Noo leen toxorool, fecculeen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">nu dëjal leen, yuuxuwuleen.”<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ndaxte Yaxya daa dikk, lekkul, naanul, ñu naay: “Aw rab la àndal.” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" /><char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki ñëw, di lekk aka naan, ñu naay: “Kee fuqle, naan-katub biiñ biiy xaritook <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> yeek bàkkaarkat yi!” Waaye xel mu rafet, jëf ja mooy la koy dëggal.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéemu, tuub mbaa sànku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu ŋàññ na waa dëkk ya fa mu def la ëpp cay kéemaanam, te taxul ñu tuub. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Mu ne: «Wóoy ngalla yeen waa Korasin, yeen waa Betsayda it, wóoy ngalla yeen, nde kéemaan yi ame fi seen biir, su doon fa waa <char style="w" lemma="Tir:">Tir</char>, mbaa fa waa Sidon la ame, kon bu yàgg lañu doon sol ay saaku, xëppoo dóomu-taal, ngir tuub. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Waaye maa leen ko wax, keroog bés-pénc, waa Tir ak Sidon a leen di gënu demin, yeen. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Yeen waa Kapernawum nag, ndax dees na leen yékkati ba asamaan am déet? Xanaa ba fa njaniiw kay ngeen di wàcci, nde kéemaan yi ame fi seen biir, su doon fa <char style="w" lemma="Sodom ak Gomor:">Sodom</char> la ame, fa la dëkk ba doon des ba tey. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Waaye maa leen ko wax, keroog bés-pénc, waa Sodom a leen di gënu demin.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woote bu mag jib na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ca jamono yooyu la Yeesu àddu ne: «Baay, Boroom asamaan ak suuf, sant naa la, nde yaa làq lii boroom xam-xam yeek boroom xel yi, xamal ko tuut-tànk yi, <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />nde loolu de, Baay, mooy li la soob. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Lépp la ma sama Baay dénk, te kenn ràññeewul Doom ji, ku dul Baay bi; Baay bi it, kenn ràññeewu ko, ku dul Doom ji, ak képp ku ko Doom ji namma xamal.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Mboolem yeen ñi loof ndax sëf bu diis, ñëwleen ci man, man maa leen di noppal. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Tegooleen sama kilifteef te ngeen jànge ci man, daldi dajeek noflaayal xol, ndax maa lewet, woyof. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Sama kilifteef sedd na, te samab sëf woyof.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu, boroom bésub Noflaay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ca jamono yooyu la Yeesu doon dem, ba jaare ci ay tool yu ñor, mu yemook <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char>. Taalibeem ya nag xiif, daldi tàmbalee fàq ay gub, di lekk. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya gis ca, ne Yeesu: «Gisal, say taalibee ngi def lu yoon mayewul ci bésub Noflaay!»<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Teewul Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa jànguleen la <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> defoon, ba mu xiifee, moom ak ña mu àndaloon? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ba Daawuda duggee ca kër Yàlla ga, <char style="w" lemma="mburum teewal m-:">mburum teewal</char> ma la lekk, te yoon mayewul kenn ku ca lekk; du moom, du ña mu àndaloon, xanaa <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ba doŋŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">1.Samiyel</char> 21.2-7.</note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Am jànguleen ci yoonu Musaa, ne bésub Noflaay, ci la sarxalkat ya ca kër Yàlla ga di xëtte ndigalal ñàkka liggéey ci bésub Noflaay, te taxu leena tooñ? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Waaye maa leen ko wax, ku sut kër Yàllaa ngi fi teew. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Su ngeen xamoon lu lii di tekki: “Ngor laa namm, dub sarax<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Ose</char> 6.6.</note>,” kon dungeen sikk jàmbur ñu deful dara, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />ndax bésub Noflaay, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki mooy boroom.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na nit ku loxoom làggi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu jóge foofa, dem ca seen jàngu ba. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Boroom loxo bu làggee nga fa woon. <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya nag laaj ko ne ko ndax yoon maye na faj ci <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char>, ngir ñu man koo tuumaal. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ana kan ci yeen mooy am menn xar doŋŋ, mu daanu ci kàmb, bésub Noflaay, te jàppu ko, génne? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ñaata yoon la nit ëppe solo am xar? Kon kay yoon maye na def lu baax, bésub Noflaay.»<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ci kaw loolu mu ne waa ja: «Tàllalal sa loxo!» Mu tàllal, loxo ba wér, ni ba ca des.<verse eid="MAT 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ba loolu amee Farisen ya génn, diisooji, ngir pexe mu ñu ko sànke. <verse eid="MAT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Teewul Yeesu yég ko, daldi jóge foofa, mbooloo mu bare nag topp ko, mu faj leen ñoom ñépp, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />te di leen femmu, ngir ñu bañ koo siiwal. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Noonu la kàddu ga ñu waxoon ci jottalib Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char>, mate. Mooy ba mu nee:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Sama ndaw lii laa tànn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">muy sama soppey xol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">maay sol sama Xel ci moom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ba mu yégal xeet yi yoonu àtte.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Du xuloo, du xaacu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">baatam du dégtoo mbedd ya.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Barax bu lemu sax, du ko damm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">leer gu giim, du ko fey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">ba kera mu mayee njub, ndam,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />te aw turam la xeet yiy yaakaar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.18-21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 42.1-4.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na boroom rab bu gumba, luu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Gannaaw loolu ñu indil Yeesu boroom rab bu gumba, luu. Yeesu faj ko, ba muy wax, di gis. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mbooloo mépp nag yéemu, naan: «Xanaa kii du Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> bi?»<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Teewul ba <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya déggee loolu dañu ne: «Kii xanaa du ci Beelsebul buuru rab yi doŋŋ lay dàqe ay rab!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Teewul Yeesu ràññee seen xalaat, ne leen: «Gépp nguur guy xàjjalikoo ci biiram, day tas, te bépp dëkk mbaa kër guy xàjjalikoo ci biiram, du mana yàgg. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" /><char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> nag su dàqee Seytaane, indi na xàjjalikoo ci biiram; te kon ana nu nguuram di yàgge? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Te bu fekkee ne man Beelsebul laay dàqe rab yi, seen ñoñ nag ñoom, kan lañuy dàqe ay rab? Kon kay seen ñoñ a leen tiiñal. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Waaye su dee <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> laay dàqe rab yi nag, kon nguurug Yàlla agsi na ba ci yeen.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />«Ana nu nit mana dugge ci kër ponkal, yóbbu alalam, te njëkkula yeew ponkal mi ba noppi, doora mana toj kër ga. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Ku farul ak man nag, man ngay xeex, te ku àndul ak man di dajale, yaa ngi tasaare.»<verse eid="MAT 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sosal Noowug Yàlla moo yées</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />«Moo tax ma ne leen, bépp bàkkaar, ak gépp kàddug saaga Yàlla, dees na ko jéggale, waaye saaga <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char>, deesu ko jéggale. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ku jëme kàddug safaan ci <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, dees na ko jéggal, waaye ku jëme kàddug safaan ci Noo gu Sell gi, deesu ko jéggal mukk, du tey, du ëllëg.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Yaar garab gi baax, meññeefam baax, mbaa garab gi bon, meññeefam bon; nde garab, meññeefam. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Njurum jaan mi ngeen doon, nu ngeen mana waxe lu baax, te di ñu bon? Gémmiñ, la fees xolu boroom lay wax. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Nit ku baax, ci dencub ngëneel lay jële lu baax, nit ku bon it, ci dencub safaanam lay jële lu bon. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Maa leen wax ne leen, gépp kàddug neen gu nit masa wax, dina ko layoo kera bés-pénc. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Ndax kat ci sa kàddu lees lay joxe dëgg, ci sa kàddu it lees lay daane.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonent Yàlla Yunus doy na firnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ci kaw loolu ay firikati yoonu Musaa ak ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> wax ak Yeesu ne ko: «Kilifa gi, danoo bëgg firnde ju bawoo ci yaw.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maas gu bon gu ñàkk kóllëre, firnde lañuy wut, waaye deesu leen jox jenn firnde ju moy firndey Yonent Yàlla Yunus. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ndax na Yunus nekke woon ca biir rabu géej wu mag wa, ñetti bëccëg ak ñetti guddi, noonu la <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki di nekke ci biir xolu suuf, ñetti bëccëg ak ñetti guddi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Waa réewum Niniw it keroog àtte ba dinañu taxaw, layook niti tey jii, tiiñal leen, ndax ñoo tuube woon ca waareb Yunus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yunus</char> 1.2; 3.4-5.</note>, te tey jii, ku sut Yunus a ngi fi. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Keroog àtte ba, Lingeeru bëj-saalum dina jóg, janook niti tey jii, tiiñal leen; ndax moo bàyyikoo woon ca catal àddina, ngir déglusi xam-xamu Suleymaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">2.Jaar-jaar ya</char> 9.1-12.</note>, te tey jii, ku sut Suleymaan a ngi fi.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Aw <char style="w" lemma="rab:">rab</char> nag, bu jàppee nit ba bàyyi ko, day wër béreb yu fendi, di wut fu mu noppaloo, te du ko gis. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Su ko defee mu ne: “Ca sama kër ga ma jóge woon laay dellu.” Bu dikkee, fekk kër gi wéet, buube, defare ba jekk. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Day dem nag indi yeneen juróom ñaari rab yu ko yées, ànd ak ñoom, ñu bokk sancsi; su ko defee ni nit kiy mujje mooy yées na mu jëkke. Noonu lay deme ci niti tey ñu bon ñii.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Déggal Yàllaa gën bokk ak Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yeesu moo doon wax ak mbooloo ma, yaayam ak ay rakki Yeesu jekki dikk, taxaw ci biti, bëgga wax ak moom. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Kenn ca mbooloo ma ne ko: «Sa yaay ak say rakk kat, ñu ngi taxaw ci biti, bëgga wax ak yaw.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Teewul Yeesu ne ko: «Ana kan mooy sama yaay, ak ñan ñooy samay rakk?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Mu daldi joxoñ ay taalibeem, ne: «Ñii ñooy sama yaay ak samay rakk, <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />ndax kuy jëfe sama coobarey Baay ba fa asamaan, kooku moo di sama rakk ju góor, di samab jigéen, di sama yaay.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Jiwu wuute na aw demin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Bésub keroog booba la Yeesu jóge kër ga, dem toog ca tàkkal dex ga. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mbooloo mu bare daje fa moom, ba mu mujj dugg ci gaal, toog; mbooloo mépp taxaw ca tàkk ga.<verse eid="MAT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu wax leen lu bare ciy léeb. Mu ne leen: «Dama ne, boroom jiwu moo demoon jiwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Naka lay saaw ab toolam, ndeke lenn ca jiwu maa nga tuuru ca kaw yoon wa, picc yi dikk, lekk ko. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Leneen la nag tuuru fu barey doj, te suuf sa néew. Mu ne coleet ca saa sa, ndax la suuf sa xóotul. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Teewul ba jant bi jógee, mu lakk, daldi wow, ndax ñàkkub reen. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Leneen la tuuru ca xaaxaam ma, xaaxaam ma sëq, tanc ko. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />La des ca jiwu ma nag tuuru ca suuf su baax, ba meññ; wii fepp meññal téeméer; wee, juróom benn fukk; wale, fanweer. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ku ami nopp, na dégg.»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku déggadi la Yeesu di léeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Gannaaw loolu ay taalibeem dikk, laaj ko ne ko: «Lu tax ngay wax ak nit ñi ci ay léeb?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Mu ne leen: «Yeen lañu may ngeen xam mbóoti nguurug asamaan, waaye ñale, mayeesu leen ko. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ndax ku am, dees na ko dolli, ba mu barele; waaye ku amul, la mu am as néew sax, dees na ko nangu. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ci ay léeb laay wax ak ñoom, ngir ñuy xoole te duñu gis, di déglu te duñu dégg, duñu xam. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> ya <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> jottali, ci ñoom la sottee. Mooy ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Yeenay dégloo déglu, dungeen dégg;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">di xoolee xoole, dungeen gis.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ndax xolu xeet wee, dërkiis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">seeni nopp fatt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ñu gëmm fatuus,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ngir seeni gët du gis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">seeni nopp du dégg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">seen xol it du yég,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ba ñu dëpp, ma wéral leen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14-15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 6.9-10.</note>.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Waaye ndokkalee yeen, nde seeni gët a ngi gis, seeni nopp di dégg! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Maa leen ko wax déy, bare na ay yonent ak nit ñu jub ñu nammoona gis li ngeen gis te gisuñu ko, ak itam dégg li ngeen dégg te dégguñu ko.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu firi na léebu jiwu mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Kon nag yeen dégluleen pirim léebu boroom nji mi. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Képp ku dégg kàddug nguurug Yàlla, su ko xamul, <char style="w" lemma="ku bon ki:">ku bon ki</char> mooy dikk, këf jiwu mi ci xolam; kooku mooy ki jote jiwu mi ci kaw yoon wi. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ki jote jiwu mi fu barey doj nag, mooy ki dégg kàddu gi rekk, nangoo ko xol bu sedd ci saa si. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Waaye ab reen la jotula saxle ci biiram, moo tax du ko wéye. Bu coono dikkee, mbaa ñu bunduxataal ko ndax kàddu gi, day dellu gannaaw ci saa si. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ki jote jiwu mi ci xaaxaam yi, mooy ki déglu kàddu gi, te xalaati àddina ak naxey alal fatt kàddu gi, ba tax meññul. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ki jote jiwu mi ci suuf su baax si nag, mooy ki déglu kàddu gi, dégg ko, ba meññal, muy lu mat téeméeri yoon lu ëpp li ñu ji woon; muy juróom benn fukk mbaa fanweer.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab jëmb misaal na nguurug Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yeesu léebati leen, ne leen: «Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni nit ku ji jiwu mu baax cib toolam. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Naka la nit ñay nelaw, ab noonam dikk, ji ab jëmb ci biir pepp mi, daldi dem. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ba pepp ma saxee ba defi gub, jëmb ba itam feeñ.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />«Ba loolu amee surgay boroom kër ga dikk ne boroom kër ga: “Sang bi, xanaa du jiwu mu baax nga jiwoon ci sa tool bi? Ana kon fu jëmb bi jóge?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Mu ne leen: “Ab noon a def loolu.” Surga ya ne ko: “Tee noo dem, wolli ko?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Mu ne leen: “Déedéet, lu ko moy ngeen wolli ko, ba far buddiwaale pepp mi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Bàyyileen leen ñoom ñaar, ñu màgg, ba ngóob jot. Bu ngóob jotee nag, góobkat yi laay wax ne leen: ‘Jëkkleena wolli jëmb bi, takk koy say, ngir lakk ko, te ngeen yeb pepp mi ci samam sàq.’ ”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doomu fuddën misaal na nguurug Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yeesu léebati leen, ne leen: «Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni doomu fuddën bu nit jël, ji ko cib toolam. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Doomu fuddën moo gëna tuut ci mboolem jiwu, waaye bu saxee ba màgg, mooy sut ci gàncax gi, ba mujj di garab gu njanaaw yiy dikk, tàgg ciy caram.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lawiir misaal na nguurug Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yeesu léebati leen: «Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni lawiir ju jigéen sàkk, def ko ci ñetti natti sunguf yu mag<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ñetti natti sunguf </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu ngi tollu ci 25 kilo.</char></note>, ba tooyal bépp mujj funki.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Kàddu yooyu yépp, ay léeb la ko Yeesu waxe mbooloo ma. Waxu leen dara lu moy ci aw léeb. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Noonu la kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ci gémmiñu yonent ba, mate. Mooy ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Ciy léeb laay waxe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">di biral mbir yu dale làqu ca njàlbéenu àddina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 78.2.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu firi na léebu jëmb bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu yiwikoo ca mbooloo ma, daldi dugg ca kër ga. Taalibeem ya dikk ne ko: «Firil nu léebu jëmb bi sax ci tool bi.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ki ji jiwu mu baax mi mooy <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Tool bi mooy àddina; jiwu mu baax moomu mooy niti nguurug Yàlla; jëmb bi di niti <char style="w" lemma="ku bon ki:">ku bon ki</char>. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Noon bi ko ji mooy <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char>; ngóob mi mooy tukkitel àddina, góobkat yi di malaaka yi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Noonu ñu wollee jëmb ba, lakk ko, ni lay deme ca tukkitel àddina. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Doomu nit ki mooy yebal ay malaakaam, ñu wollee ci nguuram mboolem luy bàkkaarloo, ak mboolem defkati ndëngte, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />sànni leen sawara; foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Su booba aji jub ñi dañu naa ràññ ni jant bi, fa seen nguurug Baay. Ku ami nopp, na dégg.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nguurug asamaan moo gën alal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni alal ju ñu làq cib tool. Nit gis ko, làqaat, xol ba sedd, ba mu dem jaay mboolem lu mu am, jënd tool ba.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Nguurug asamaan dafa mel it ni jula buy wut peri gànjar. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Mu gis nag per buy jar lu bare, daldi jaay mboolem lu mu am, ba jënd per ba.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbaalum géej misaal na nguurug asamaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Nguurug asamaan mel na it ni mbaal mu ñu sànni biir géej, mu jàpp wirgoy jën wu nekk. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Mbaal ma fees, ñu xëcc ba ci tefes gi, daldi toog, tànn yu baax yi, def ciy dàmba; yu bon yi, ñu sànni ca biti. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Noonu lay deme, ca tukkitel àddina. Malaaka yeey dem, seppi ñu bon ñi ci biir aji jub ñi, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />sànni leen sawara. Foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dëgg yees na, yàgg na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yeesu nag laaj taalibe ya, ne leen: «Ndax xam ngeen lu loolu lépp di tekki?» Ñu ne ko: «Waaw.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Mu ne leen: «Kon nag bépp firikatu yoon bu ñu jàngal mbirum nguurug asamaan, dafa mel ni boroom kër bu yebbee cib dencam, lu yees ak lu yàgg.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nasaret gàntal na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ba Yeesu sottalee ca léeb yooyu la fa bàyyikoo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />daldi dellu dëkk ba mu yaroo. Mu di leen jàngal nag ca seen jàngu, ba ñu yéemu naan: «Ana fu kii jële bii xam-xam, ak yii kéemaan? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Xanaa kii du doomu minise bi? Xanaa du Maryaama mooy yaayam? Rakkam yu góor di Yanqóoba ak Yuusufa ak Simoŋ ak Yudd? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Xanaa du nook jigéenam ñépp a dëkk? Ana fu kii jële lii lépp nag?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ñu daldi gise mbir ma ag yabeel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yeesu nag ne leen: «Ab yonent, deesu ko xeebe fenn fu moy réewu boppam ak ci biir waa këram.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yeesu defu fa kéemaan yu bare ndax seen ngëmadi.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yaxya faatu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ci jamono yooyu la <char style="w" lemma="Erodd:">Erodd</char> boroom Galile dégg turu Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Mu ne ay surgaam: «Kooku mooy <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char>. Moo dekki noonu, moo waral xam-xam yu kéemaane yi feeñe ci moom.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Erodd nag moo jàppoon Yaxya, yeew ko, tëj, ndax gannaaw ba Erodd jëlee Erojàdd jabaru Filib magam, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Yaxya moo wax Erodd, ne ko yoon mayu ko mu denc ndaw si. <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Erodd nag bëgga rey Yaxya, te ragal nit ña, ndax yonent ga ñu ko jàppe woon.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ba ñu demee bay baaxantal bésu juddub Erodd, doomu Erojàdd ju jigéen fecc ca géew ba, Erodd am ca mbégte, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />ba dig ko ci kaw ngiñ ne ko: «Loo laaj, ma jox la ko.» <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Ndaw sa nag wax Erodd, ci ndigalal yaayam, ne ko: «Indil ma fii boppu Yaxya ci ndab.»<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Aw tiis nag dikkal Buur Erodd, ndax ngiñ la, ak gan ña. Teewul mu joxe ndigal ngir ñu jox ko ko, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />daldi yónnee, ñu dog boppu Yaxya ca kaso ba. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ci kaw loolu ñu indi bopp bi ci ndab, jox ko janq ba, mu yót yaayam. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ba mu ko defee taalibey Yaxya dikk, yóbbu néew ba, denc ko. Ñu dem nag, wax ko Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu leel na mbooloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ba Yeesu déggee loolu da faa bàyyikoo, dugg gaal, jëm béreb bu wéet, ngir beruji fa. Teewul nit ña yég ko, bàbbeekoo ca dëkk ya, leru tefes gi, topp ko. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ba mu wàccee ca gaal ga, mbooloo mu réy la gis. Mu ñeewante leen, daldi faj seeni jarag.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ca ngoon sa taalibe yi dikk, ne ko: «Fii àllub neen la, te guddi na xaat. Dangay yiwi mbooloo mi, ngir ñu dem ci dëkk yu ndaw yi, jënd ag lekk.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Teewul Yeesu ne leen: «Jarul ñu dem, yeen joxleen leen lu ñu lekk.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ñu ne ko: «Amunu fi lu dul juróomi mburu ak ñaari jën.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yeesu ne leen: «Indilleen ma ko fii.»<verse eid="MAT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu sant mbooloo ma, ñu toog ca ñax ma. Mu jël juróomi mburu ya ak ñaari jën ya, xool kaw asamaan, daldi yékkati kàddug cant, dagg mburu ma, jox ko taalibe ya, ñu séddale ko mbooloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Ñépp lekk ba regg, ba ñu yóbbu desit ya, muy fukki pañe ak ñaar yu fees. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Ña ca xéewlu nag juróomi junni (5 000) góor lañu, limaaleesul jigéen ña ak gone ya.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dox na ca kaw ndox ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu duggloo taalibeem ya ca gaal ga, ngir ñu jàllagum, jiituji ko ca wàlla, ba kera mu yiwi mbooloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Mu yiwi mbooloo ma, daldi yéegi ca tund wa, ngir ñaan. Ba guddi jotee moom doŋŋ a fa nekkoon.<verse eid="MAT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Booba gaal ga dem na xaat ba dànd tefes ga, diggante bu takku, gannax ya di ko baaje, ndax ngelaw la leen soflu. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ba suuf seddee, Yeesu dox ci kaw dex gi, wutsi leen. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Taalibe ya gis ko, muy dox ca kaw dex ga, ñu daldi jommi, naan: «Njuuma la!» di yuuxoo ndax tiitaange. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Yeesu wax ak ñoom ca saa sa, ne leen: «Dalleen, man mii la, buleen tiit!»<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piyeer nag ne tonet, ne ko: «Sang bi, su dee yaw, sant ma, ma dox ci kaw ndox mi, ba ci yaw.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yeesu ne ko: «Kaay!» Piyeer wàcce ca gaal ga, dox ci kaw ndox mi, jëm ca Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Teewul ba mu gisee na ngelaw la riddee, dafa tiit, tàmbalee suux. Mu àddu ca kaw, ne: «Sang bi, wallu ma!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Yeesu daldi tàllal loxoom, jàpp ko, ne ko: «Yaaka néew ngëm, ana looy xel ñaar?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ci kaw loolu ñu dugg ca gaal ga, ngelaw la dal. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Taalibe ya ca gaal ga nag sujjóotal ko, ne ko: «Aylayéwén, yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> ji.»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ba loolu amee ñu jàll dex ga, daldi teeri ca diiwaanu Senesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Niti gox ba xàmmee Yeesu, daldi yónnee ca diiwaan bépp, indil ko mboolem ña wopp. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Ci biir loolu ñuy sarxu Yeesu, ngir mu may leen ñu laal lu mu néew néew catu mbubbam, te képp ku ca laal wér nga péŋŋ.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Farisen aada la jiital</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ca jamono yooyu la ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ak ay firikati yoonu Musaa bàyyikoo Yerusalem, dikk ba ci Yeesu, ne ko: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Lu tax say taalibe di jalgati aaday maam yi, ba duñu raxas seeni loxo, bala ñoo lekk?» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Yeen itam lu tax ngeen di jalgati santaaneb Yàlla, ndax seen aaday bopp? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ndax Yàlla da ne: “Teralal ndey ak baay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.12.</note>,” neeti: “Ku saaga sa ndey mbaa sa baay, dee rekk mooy àtteem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 21.17.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Te yeen ngeen ne: “Ku ne sa ndey mbaa sa baay: ‘Li ma warlook yaw, jébbal naa ko Yàlla,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />kooku wàccoo na ak warugaru teral baayam.” Kon kay neenal ngeen kàddug Yàlla ndax seen aaday bopp. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Jinigalkat yi ngeen doon, <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> yey na, ba mu jottalee kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> ci seen mbir, ne:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Askan wii, làmmiñ lañu may wormaale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">waaye seen xol sore na ma.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Seen njaamu Yàlla neen la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">seen njàngale di santaaney niti kese<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.8-9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 29.13.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu woo mbooloo ma, ne leen: «Dégluleen te amug dégg. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Du li dugg ci gémmiñ mooy sobeel nit ki, waaye liy génne ci gémmiñ, loolu mooy sobeel nit ki.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ba loolu amee taalibe ya dikk ne ko: «Ndax xam nga ne, ba Farisen yi déggee kàddu googu, mer nañu?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yeesu ne leen: «Gépp gàncax gu sama Baay ba fa asamaan jëmbatul, dees na ko buddi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Bàyyileen leen, ay gumba yuy wommat ay gumba lañu; gumba nag, su dee wommat gumba, ñoom ñaar ay ànd tàbbi ci kàmb.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piyeer nag ne Yeesu: «Firil nu léeb woowu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yeesu ne ko: «Kon yeen itam amuleenug dégg ba tey? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Xamuleen ne, lépp lu dugg ci gémmiñ, ci koll bi lay dugg, balaa jàll, génneji gannaaw kër? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Li génne ci gémmiñ nag ci xolu boroom la jóge, te loolu mooy sobeel nit ki. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ndaxte ci xol la mébét yu bon di jóge, ak bóom, ak njaaloo, ak séy yi yoon tere, ak càcc, ak seede lu dul dëgg, ak saaga. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Yooyu mooy sobeel nit ki, waaye lekk te raxasuwuloo sobeelul nit.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu baaxe na jàmbur bu dul yawut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu jóge fa, dem diiwaanu <char style="w" lemma="Tir:">Tir ak Sidon</char>. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ci kaw loolu as ndawas Kanaaneen jekki jóge ca gox booba, di wax ca kaw, naan: «Sang bi, Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, yërëm ma! Sama doom ju jigéen la rab jàpp, mu sonn lool.» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Yeesu nag tontuwu ko baat, taalibeem ya dikk ne ko: «Dàqal kii nu topp, di yuuxu ci sunu kaw!» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yeesu daldi ne: «Yebaleesu ma fu dul ci xari <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> yi réer.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Teewul ndaw sa dikk, sujjóotal ko, ne ko: «Sang bi, dimbali ma!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yeesu ne ko: «Jël ñamu gone yi, sànni ko kuti yi, jaaduwul.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ndaw sa ne ko: «Dëgg la, Sang bi, waaye teewul kuti yi for ca la ruuse ca seen ndabal boroom.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Ndaw sii, yaaka réy ngëm. Kon nag na la amal noonu nga ko bëgge.» Ca waxtu woowa la doom ja wér.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ñu wopp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu bàyyikoo foofa, dem ca tàkkal dexu Galile. Mu yéeg ca kaw tund wa, toog fa. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mbooloo mu bare dikk, ànd aki lafañ, ak ay gumba, ak boroomi laago, aki luu, ak boroom jàngoro yu bare. Ñu indi leen fa kanam Yeesu, mu faj leen, <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />ba mbooloo ma waaru ca lañu gis luu ya di wax, boroom laago ya wér, lafañ ya di dox, gumba ya di gis. Ñu daldi sàbbaal Yàllay Israayil.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu leelati na mbooloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu woo taalibeem ya, ne leen: «Damaa yërëm mbooloo mi, ndax ñetti fan a ngii yu ñu nekk ak man, te amuñu lu ñu lekk. Bëgguma leena yiwi, ñu deme xiif, bala ñoo tële ci yoon wi.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Taalibe ya ne ko: «Waaye fu nuy jële ci àll bu wéet bi mburu mu suur mbooloo mu réye nii?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñaata mburu ngeen am?» Ñu ne ko: «Juróom ñaari mburu ak as jën.»<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Ba mu ko defee Yeesu sant mbooloo ma ñu toog ci suuf. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Mu jël juróom ñaari mburu ya ak jën ya, daldi yékkati kàddug cant, dagg mburu ma, jox taalibe ya, ñu jox mbooloo ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ñépp lekk ba regg, te desit wa ñu yóbbu di juróom ñaari dàmba yu fees. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Ña ca lekk ñeenti junniy (4 000) góor lañu, te limaaleesul jigéen ña ak gone ya.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu yiwi mbooloo ma, daldi dugg gaal, jàll ba diiwaanu Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Diiŋatkat laaj na firnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ak ay <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> nag ñoo dikkoon ci Yeesu, di ko fiir, ne ko: «Firnde ju bawoo asamaan lanu bëgg, nga won nu ko.» <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yeesu ne leen: «Su ngoonee ngeen ne: “Ëllëg de day naaj, nde asamaan si daa xonq.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Su dee ag suba ngeen ne: “Tey dina taw, asamaan saa ngi xiin, xonq curr.” Kon man ngeena ràññee melow asamaan, te manuleena ràññee firndey janti tey. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Maas gu bon te ñàkk kóllëre gi ngeen doon, firnde ngeen di wut, waaye deesuleen jox jenn firnde ju moy firndey Yunus.» Gannaaw loolu, mu bàyyikoo fa ñoom, dem.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misaal tiiñ na taalibe ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />La ca tegu, taalibe ya jàllaat dex ga, ndeke fàtte nañoo yóbbaale mburu. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yeesu ne leen: «Wattuleen te moytu lawiiru <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ñi ak <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> ñi.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Taalibe ya nag di werante ci seen biir naan: «Nun de yóbbaalewunu mburu.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yeesu xam la ñuy wax, ne leen: «Yeenaka néew ngëm, lu ngeen di werante ci seen biir, naan amuleen fi mburu? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Kon xamaguleen ba tey, fàttalikuwuleen it juróomi mburu ya ca juróomi junniy (5 000) nit ña, ak ñaata pañey desit ngeen ca jële? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Juróom ñaari mburu ya ca ñeenti junniy (4 000) nit ña nag, ñaata dàmbay desit ngeen ca jële? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Nu ngeen mana umplee ne du mburoo ma tax di wax, ne ngeen wattu lawiiru Farisen ñeek Sadusen ñi?» <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ca lañu doora xam ne du lawiiru mburoo ko tax di wax, waaye njàngalem Farisen ña ak Sadusen ña, moom la leen wax ñu wattu ko.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer dégg na ndéey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ba Yeesu demee ca diiwaan ba féete péeyu Sesare gu Filib, mu laaj taalibeem ya, ne leen: «Ana ku nit ñi wax ne mooy <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Taalibe yi ne ko: «Ñii de nee ñu <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> la, ñee ne, <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> la; ñale ne Yeremi la, mbaa keneen ci yonent yi.»<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yeesu ne leen: «Yeen nag, ngeen ne maay kan?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoŋ Piyeer ne ko: «Yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> Aji Dund ji.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ndokkalee yaw, Simoŋ doomu Yowaan, ndax nit xamalu la ko, xanaa sama Baay ba fa asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Man nag maa ne la, yaa di Piyeer, doj wi; ci kaw doj wii it laay samp mbooloom gëmkat ñi, te dooley dee du ko manal dara. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Maa lay jox caabiy nguurug asamaan, te loo yeew ci kaw suuf, yeewees na ko fa asamaan; loo yiwi ci kaw suuf it, yiwees na ko fa asamaan.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu dénku taalibe yi, ngir ñu baña wax kenn ne mooy Almasi bi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ci jamono yooyu la Yeesu tàmbalee xamal taalibeem ya ne fàww mu dem Yerusalem, ba daje fa ak coono yu bare yu bawoo ca magi askan wa, ak <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya, ak firikati yoonu Musaa ya, te dees na ko rey, ba ñetteelu fan ba, mu dekki. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Ci kaw loolu Piyeer ñaarook moom, tàmbali koo femmu, ne ko: «Yàlla tere, Sang bi, loolu du la dal mukk.» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Teewul Yeesu geestu, ne Piyeer: «<char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char>, xiddi ma, te dellu gannaaw, yaa ngi may gàllankoor; yaw xalaatoo yëfi Yàlla, waaye yëfi nit ngay xalaat.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu ne taalibeem ya: «Ku bëgga dikk topp ma, fàtteel sa bopp te nga gàddu sa bant bi ñu lay daaj, door maa topp. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ndaxte képp ku bëgga rawale sa bakkan, dinga ko ñàkk, te ku ñàkk sa bakkan ndax man, dinga ko jotaat. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Te it jagoo àddina sépp lu muy jariñ nit, bu ñàkkee bakkanam? Ak lu nit wara mana weccee bakkanam? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Doomu nit ki de mooy dikke darajay Baayam, ànd aki malaakaam, te su boobaa mooy fey ku nekk ay jëfam. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Maa leen ko wax déy, ñenn a ngi taxaw fii, duñu dee te gisuñu Doomu nit ki ñëw ci nguuram.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Leeru Yeesu feeñ na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ba ñu ca tegee juróom benni fan, Yeesu ànd na ak Piyeer ak Yanqóoba ak Yowaan rakku Yanqóoba, yóbbu leen kaw tund wu kawe, ngir wéetook ñoom. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Mu soppiku fa seen kanam, xar kanamam di melax nib jant, ay yéreem weex nig leer. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Ci kaw loolu Yonent Yàlla Musaa ak Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> jekki feeñu leen, di waxtaan ak Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piyeer nag ne Yeesu: «Sang bi, su nu toogoon fii de, mu baax ci nun. Soo nangoo ma yékkati fii ñetti mbaar, benn yaw, benn Musaa, benn Ilyaas.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Naka lay wax ba tey, niir wu leer yiir leen, baat jekki jibe ca niir wa ne: «Kii mooy sama Doom, sama soppe, moom laay bànneexoo; dégluleen ko.»<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ba ca taalibe ya déggee, dañu ne dàll, dëpp seen jë fa suuf, tiit lool. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yeesu dikk, <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg leen loxoom</char>, ne leen: «Jógleen, buleen tiit.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ñu séentu ca kaw, gisuñu ku dul mennum Yeesu doŋŋ.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Naka lañuy wàcce ca tund wa, Yeesu sant leen, ne leen «Buleen nettali kenn peeñu mi, ba kera <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki dekki.» <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ci kaw loolu taalibe ya laaj ko, ne ko: «Lu tax nag firikati yoonu Musaa yi ne fàww Ilyaas njëkka ñëw?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yeesu ne leen: «Waaw, Ilyaas kay mooy ñëw, ba jubbanti lépp. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Maa leen wax nag ne leen Ilyaas ñëw na ba noppi, waaye xàmmeesu ko, te it lu leen neex lañu def ak moom. Noonu it la Doomu nit ki nara sonne ci seeni loxo.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Booba nag la taalibe ya xam ne mbirum <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> la leen di wax noonu.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na xale buy say</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ba ñu dikkee ba jub mbooloo ma, genn góor dikk, sukk fa kanamam, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ne ko: «Sang bi, yërëmal sama doom. Day say te sonn na lool; léeg-léeg mu daanu ci sawara, léeg-léeg mu daanu ci ndox. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Indi naa ko ci say taalibe, waaye manuñu koo faj.»<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yeesu nag ne: «Céy niti tey, yeena gëmadi te dëng, maak yeen ba kañ? Dama leen di muñal ba kañ?» Mu ne leen: «Indilleen ma xale bi fii.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu gëdd rab wa, rab wa génne ca xale ba, mu daldi wér ca waxtu wa.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />La ca tegu taalibe ya dikk ba ca Yeesu, daldi koy laaj ci sutura, ne ko: «Lu waral manunu woona dàqal sunu bopp, rab wi?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20-21" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa seenug néew ngëm. Maa leen ko wax déy, su ngeen amee ci ngëm, lu tollu ni peppu fuddën, dingeen ne tund wii: “Toxool fii, ba fale,” mu toxu, te dara du leen të.»<verse eid="MAT 17:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu baamtu na ag mujam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ba Yeesu ak taalibe ya dajee ca diiwaanu Galile nag, Yeesu da ne leen: «<char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki lees di wor léegi, ngir teg ko ci loxoy nit ñi; <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />dees na ko rey, mu dekki ca ñetteelu fanam.» Ñu daldi am tiis wu réy lool.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu fey na lu ko warul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ba Yeesu ak taalibe ya agsee Kapernawum, feyeekukati galagu kër Yàlla ga ñoo dikk, ne Piyeer: «Xanaa seen kilifa gi da dul fey galagu kër Yàlla gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">galagu kër Yàlla </char><char style="ft" closed="false">googu, ñaari daraxma la. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 30.13.</note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Piyeer ne leen: «Ahakay!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Ba ñu àggee ca kër ga, Yeesu jiitu Piyeer ca wax ja, ne ko: «Ana luy sa xalaat ci lii, Simoŋ? Ñan la buuri àddina di feyeeku ab juuti mbaa galag? Seenug njaboot, am doxandéem yi?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Mu ne ko: «Xanaa doxandéem yi.» Yeesu ne ko: «Kon nag ag pey wàcc na njaboot gi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Waaye bunu leen naqaral; demal ca dex ga, nga sànni sab oos te ñoddi jën wa nga njëkka jàpp. Boo ubbee gémmiñ ga, dinga ca fekk ab poset<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">poset </char><char style="ft" closed="false">boobu ab estateer lañu koy wax.</char></note>. Moom ngay jël, dem, jox leen ko ngir maak yaw.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Tuut tey, sut ëllëg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ca waxtu woowa la taalibe ya dikkoon ne Yeesu: «Kon nag kan moo gëna kawe ci nguurug asamaan?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yeesu daldi woo ab xale, taxawal ko ci seen biir. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Mu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, su ngeen dëppul, ba mujj mel niy xale, dungeen tàbbi mukk ci nguurug asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Moo tax ku tuutal boppam ba mel ni xale bii, kooku mooy ki gëna kawe ci nguurug asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Te it ku dalal ci sama tur, xale bu mel ni kii, man mii nga dalal. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Waaye ku bàkkaarloo kenn sax ci ñu tuut ñii ma gëm, li gën ci moom mooy ñu takk ci baatam doju wolukaay wu réy wu mbaam di wëndeel, daldi koy sànni biir xóotey géej.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bàkkaarloo nit ak xeebaate warul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />«Wóoy ngalla àddina, ndax fiir yi ciy bàkkaarloo. Fiir manula ñàkk, waaye wóoy ngalla ka koy lal. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Su la sab loxo mbaa sab tànk bàkkaarloo nag, dog ko, sànni fu sore, nde tàbbiwaale ab kuuñ, mbaa bennub tànk ca dund gu wóor ga, moo gën ci yaw ñu boole laak sa ñaari loxo ak sa ñaari tànk, sànni la ca sawara su dul fey. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Su la sa bët bàkkaarloo, luqil, sànni fu sore, nde tàbbiwaale patt ca dund gu wóor ga, moo gën ci yaw ñu boole laak sa ñaari bët, sànni jànnama, ca sawara wa.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10-11" />«Te it wattuleena xeeb kenn sax ci ñu tuut ñii, ndax maa leen ko wax, seen malaaka ya fa asamaan ñoo saxoo niir sama kanamu Baay ba fa asamaan.<verse eid="MAT 18:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yàlla bëggul kenn réer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />«Luy seen xalaat ci lii? Su nit amee téeméeri xar, menn lajj ci, ndax du bàyyi juróom ñeent fukki xar ya ak juróom ñeent (99) ca parlukaay ba, te dem seeti ma lajj? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Te bu ko gisee, maa leen ko wax déy, moom lay gëna bége juróom ñeent fukki xar ak juróom ñeent ya lajjul.<verse eid="MAT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />«Seen Baay ba fa asamaan itam, noonu. Bëggul kenn ci ñii gëna tuut, sànku.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bàkkaaru biiri bokk laaj na ab saytu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Bu la sa mbokk tooñee, demal ñaarook moom, yedd ko. Su la dégloo, yaa feeñle mbokk mu réeroon. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Waaye su la dégluwul, àndal ak kenn mbaa ñaar, ngir àtteb mbir mépp mana wére ci kàddug ñaari seede ba ñett. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Su leen tanqamloo, wax ko mbooloom gëmkat ñi. Su tanqamloo mbooloom gëmkat ñi itam nag, nga def ko ni ab yéefar ak ab <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char>. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Maa leen ko wax déy, lépp lu ngeen yeew ci kaw suuf, dees na ko yeew fa asamaan, te lépp lu ngeen yiwi fi kaw suuf, dees na ko yiwi fa asamaan.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />«Maa leen neeti, su ñaar ci yeen déggoo ci kaw suuf, ci mboolem lu ñu ñaan, dees na leen ko nangul ci sama dogalu Baay ba fa asamaan, <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />ndax fu ñaar mbaa ñett dajee ci sama tur, maa ngi ci seen biir.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku ñu yërëm war naa yërëme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Ca la Piyeer dikk ne Yeesu: «Sang bi, ñaata yoon la ma sama mbokk di tooñ, ma baal ko? Ndax day mat ba mu tollook juróom ñaari yoon?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yeesu ne ko: «Newuma la juróom ñaari yoon, waaye ba muy juróom ñaar fukki yoon ak juróom ñaar.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />«Moo tax nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni buur bu bëgga xayma ni alalam tollook ay jaraafam. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Naka la tàmbalee xayma, ñu indil ko ku ko ameel lu bare, tollu ci fukki junniy talaŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">talaŋ: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu wecci ay milyoŋ. Seetal </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci Leeral yi.</char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />te jaraaf ja amul lu mu feye. Sangam joxe ndigal, ngir ñu jaay ko, moom ak jabaram ak ay doomam ak mboolem alalam, ngir fey bor ba. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Jaraaf ja ne gurub, sujjóotal ko, ne ko: “Muñal ma, lépp laa lay fey.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Sang ba nag yërëm jaraaf jooju, bàyyi ko, baal ko bor ba.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />«Jaraaf ja dem, dajeek moroomu jaraafam mu ko ameel lu néew, tollu ci téeméeri <char style="w" lemma="Xaalis:">dinaar</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu wecci xaalis bu néewa néew. Seetal </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci Leeral yi.</char></note>. Mu jàpp ko, xoj ko, ne ko: “Fey ma li nga ma ameel.” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Moroom ma ne gurub ci suuf, tinu ko, ne ko: “Muñal ma, dinaa la fey.” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Teewul mu lànk, dem, tëj ko kaso, ba kera muy fey la mu ko ameel.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />«Ba moroomi jaraaf ya gisee la xew, dañu koo tiislu lool, daldi dem, àgge seenub sang mboolem la xew. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Sang ba nag woolu jaraaf ja, ne ko: “Jaraaf ju soxor ji nga doon! Sa bor bépp laa la baal, nde danga maa tinu. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ni ma la yërëme, ndax waruloo koo mana yërëme sa moroomu jaraaf?” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Sang ba mer, daldi koy jébbal mititalkati kaso ba, ba kera muy fey bor bépp.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />«Noonu la sama Baay ba fa asamaan di def ak yeen, su ku nekk ci yeen baalul mbokkam ci xol bu sedd.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pase daganul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu daaneelee kàddoom yooyu ba noppi, dafa jóge Galile, dem diiwaanu Yude, ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan, <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />mbooloo mu bare topp ko, mu faj leen foofa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ci kaw loolu ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> dikk, di ko fiir, laaj ko, ne ko: «Ndax yoon maye na nit ku fase jabaram ci lu mu mana doon?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa jànguleen ne, Ki sàkk ca njàlbéen la leen sàkk ñuy ku góor ak ku jigéen. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Yàlla moo ne: “Looloo tax góor di teqalikook ndeyam ak baayam, taqoo ak jabaram, ba ñoom ñaar di wenn suux doŋŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Njàlbéen ga</char> 1.27; 2.24.</note>”? <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Moo tax dootuñu ñaar, waaye wenn suux doŋŋ lañu. Lu Yàlla takk nag, bu ko nit tas.»<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ñu ne ko: «Ana kon lu tax Musaa santaane kayitu pase bu nit kiy jox jabaram ngir fase ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 24.1.</note>?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yeesu ne leen: «Seen dëgër xol a tax Musaa may leen ngeen fase seen jabar, waaye demewul woon noonu ca njàlbéen. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Te it maa leen ko wax, képp ku fase sa jabar, te njaaloo taxul, boo séyaatee ak keneen, njaaloo nga.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Taalibe ya nag ne ko: «Su dee loolooy àtteb góor ci jabaram kay, njariñ nekkul ci takk jabar.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yeesu ne leen: «Du ñépp a xajoo googu kàddu, xanaa ñi ñu ko jagleel rekk. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Am na ñu juddoo tële, am na ñu pexem nit taxa tële, te am na ñu mel ni dañoo tële, waaye ñoo ko bëggal seen bopp, te nguurug asamaan tax. Ku ko mana xajoo nag, xajoo ko.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gone am na yelleef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Gannaaw loolu ay xale lañu indiloon Yeesu, ngir mu <char style="w" lemma="teg loxo:">teg leen ay loxoom</char>, ñaanal leen. Teewul taalibe ya jànni leen. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Bàyyileen xale yi, te buleen leen aaye ñu ñëw fi man, ndax ñu mel ni ñoom, ñoo yelloo nguurug asamaan.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu teg leen ay loxoom, daldi fay bàyyikoo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alal gàllankoor na boroom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ci kaw loolu jenn waay jekki dikk, ne ko: «Kilifa gi, ana lu baax lu may def, ngir texe ba fàww?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ana loo may laaj ci mbirum lu baax? Te sax kenn doŋŋ ay ku baax. Waaye soo bëggee tàbbi ci dund gu wóor gi, sàmmal ndigal yi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Mu ne ko: «Yan ci?» Yeesu ne ko: «Bul bóom, bul njaaloo, bul sàcc, bul seede lu dul dëgg, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />teralal sa ndey ak sa baay, te ni nga soppe sa bopp, nanga ko soppe sa moroom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.18-19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 20.12-16; <char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 19.18.</note>.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Xalelu góor ba ne ko: «Loolu lépp sàmm naa ko, lu ma deseeti?»<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yeesu nag ne ko: «Boo bëggee mat sëkk, demal jaay li nga am, nga jox ko néew-doole yi. Su ko defee nga woomle fa asamaan. Boo noppee, ñëwal topp ci man.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Xalelu góor ba nag dégg kàddu ga, daldi fay jóge aku tiis ndax ku bare alal la woon.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yeesu nag ne taalibeem ya: «Maa leen ko wax déy, tàbbi ci nguurug asamaan dina jafe ku bare alal. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ma waxati leen ko: Boroom alal tàbbi ci nguurug Yàlla, giléem jaare bën-bënu puso moo ko gëna yomb.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ba taalibe ya déggee loolu, dañoo yéemu ba ne ko: «Kon kan moo mana mucc nag?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yeesu nag ne leen jàkk, ne: «Loolu nit la të, waaye Yàlla man na lépp.»<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ca la Piyeer ne tonet, ne ko: «Waaw, nun ñii dëddu lépp, topp la nag, nu nuy mujje?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, keroog àddina ju yees ja, bu <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki toogee ca jalub darajaam, yeen ñi ma topp itam, fukki gàngune ak ñaar ngeen di tooge, di àtte fukki giiri <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> ak ñaar. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Képp ku dëddu ay kër, mbaa ay doomi ndey yu góor mbaa yu jigéen, mbaa ndey mbaa baay, mbaa doom, mbaa suuf, ngir man, dinga ko jotaat téeméeri yoon, te dinga texe ba fàww. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Waaye ñu baree ngi jiitu tey, ñooy mujji, te ñu baree ngi mujje tey, ñooy jiituji.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bëccëg woroo na te pey ga di benn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni boroom kër bu teela xëy, di wut ay surga yu ko liggéeyal toolub reseñam. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Mu juboo ak liggéeykat ya ci bëccëg bu nekk peyug bëccëgu lëmm. Mu daldi leen yebal ca toolub reseñam. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Naka mu génn wetu juróom ñeenti waxtu ci suba, daldi gis ñeneen ñuy taxawaalu ca pénc ma, defuñu dara. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Mu ne leen: “Demleen yeen itam ca sama toolub reseñ, ma fey leen lu jaadu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ñu dem. Ci booru fukki waxtook ñaar ci bëccëg, mu dellu génn, fukki waxtook juróom itam, mu génnati, defati noona ba tey. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Wetug fukki waxtu ak juróom ñaar, mu génnati, dajeek ñeneen ñuy taxawaalu. Mu ne leen: “Lu ngeen di yendoo taxawaalu fii te defuleen dara?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Ñu ne ko: “Dees noo jëlul.” Mu ne leen: “Demleen yeen itam ca sama tool.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Ba ngoon jotee, boroom tool ba ne ab jawriñam: “Wool surga yi, fey leen seen bëccëg, te nga tàmbalee ci ñi mujja ñëw, ba ci ñi jiitu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ci kaw loolu ña ñu jëloon ca booru fukki waxtu ak juróom ñaar dikk, ku ci nekk jot peyug bëccëgu lëmm. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ña ñu njëkkoona jël dikk, yaakaar ne ñooy ëpple ag peyoor, te teewul ñu feyu, ñoom it, ku nekk peyug bëccëgu lëmm. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ñu jël, tey sikk boroom kër ga, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />naan: “Ñii mujja ñëw, liggéeyuñu lu moy wenn waxtu, nga yemale leen ak nun, ñi yenu coonob bëccëg bi, ak naaj wu tàng wi!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Teewul boroom kër ga ne kenn ka: “Sama waay, tooñuma la. Xanaa juboowunu woon ci peyug bëccëgu lëmm? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Jëlal sa yëf te dem. Li ma la fey, moom laa yéenee fey kii mujja ñëw. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Xanaa damaa sañula def lu ma neex ci sama alal? Am sab xol a bon ci samag mbaax?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Noonu la ñi mujj di jiitujee, ñi jiitu, mujje.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu baamooti na ag mujam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Gannaaw loolu nag Yeesu jëm Yerusalem, yóbbaale fukki taalibe yaak ñaar, wéetook ñoom, daldi leen xamal ca yoon wa ne leen: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Noo ngii jëm Yerusalem, te dees na wor <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, jébbal ko <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak firikati yoonu Musaa ya, ñu teg ko àtteb dee, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />jébbal ko jàmbur ñi dul Yawut, ñu ñaawal ko, caw ko, daaj ko ci bant, mu dee; ba ca ñetteelu fan ba, mu dekki.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taalibe ñaan na liy kumpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Booba la jabaru Sebede ànd ak doomam yi mu am ak moom, ñu dikk ba ca Yeesu. Jigéen ja sujjóot, ngir mbir mu muy sàkku ci moom. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yeesu ne ko: «Loo bëgg?» Mu ne ko: «Mayal sama ñaari doom yii, ñu toog, kii féete la ndijoor, kii féete la càmmoñ, keroog ca sa nguur ga.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yeesu ne ko: «Xamuleen li ngeen di ñaan. Mbaa kaasub naqar bi may naani, man ngeen koo naan?» Ñu ne ko: «Man nanu ko.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, sama kaasub naqar de, dingeen ko naan. Tooge sama ndijoor mbaa sama càmmoñ nag, du man maay maye loolu, waaye da diy cér yu ñeel ña ñu ko waajalal, ci sama dogalu Baay.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ba fukki taalibe ya ca des déggee mbir ma, seen xol tàng ca ñaari doomi ndey ya. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yeesu nag woo leen ne leen: «Xam ngeen ne njiiti xeeti àddina yi dañuy def nit ñi jaam, seeni kàngam di leen néewal doole. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Yeen nag, bumu deme noonu ci seen biir. Képp ku bëgga doon ku màgg ci yeen, na nekk seenub surga, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />te ku bëgga nekk seen njiit, na doon seenub jaam. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Noonu la deme ci <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, ñëwul ngir ñu di ko surgawu, xanaa ngir di nekk surga, ba far maye bakkanam, def ko <char style="w" lemma="jot:">njotug</char> ñépp.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ñaari gumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ba Yeesu bàyyikoo Yeriko, mbooloo mu baree ko topp. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ndeke ñaari silmaxaa nga tooge ca peggu yoon wa. Ba ñu déggee ne Yeesu mooy romb, dañoo xaacu, ne: «Sang bi, Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>, yërëm nu!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Nit ña nag femmu leen, ngir ñu noppi. Teewul gumba ya gëna xaacooti, ne: «Sang bi, Sëtub Daawuda, yërëm nu!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yeesu daldi taxaw, woo leen, ne leen: «Lu ngeen bëgg, ma defal leen ko?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ñu ne ko: «Sang bi, xanaa sunuy bët ubbiku.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yeesu nag yërëm leen, laal seeni bët, ñuy gis ca saa sa, daldi topp ca moom.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dugg na Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu ak taalibe ya dikk ba jub Yerusalem, ba agsi ca dëkk ba ñuy wax Betfase ca wetu <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya. Yeesu yebal ñaar ca taalibe ya, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ne leen: «Demleen ci dëkk bi ci seen kanam. Bu ngeen agsee rekk, dingeen fa gis mbaam mu ñu yeew ak cumburam; yiwileen leen, indil ma leen. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Su leen kenn waxee dara, ngeen ne ko: “Boroom bee leen soxla.” Mu daldi leen bàyyi, ñu dem.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Loolu nag ame noonu, ngir sottal la ñu waxoon ca jottalib yonent ba. Mooy ba mu nee:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Neleen janq <char style="w" lemma="Siyoŋ:">Siyoŋ</char> mu taaru:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">“Niiral, sa buur a la dikkal nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">di ku woyof, war mbaam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">cumbur la war, doomu mbaam-sëf<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 9.9.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Taalibe ya dem, daldi koy defe noonu leen ko Yeesu sante. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ñu indi mbaam ma ak cumbur ba, daldi teg seeni yére ca kaw cumbur ba, Yeesu war<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">cumbur: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci jamonoy jàmm, jamono yu xeex amul woon, buur yi daan nañu war mbaam, te doonul lu ñu leen di tuutal.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Ba loolu amee nit ñu bare lool lal seeni yére ca yoon wa, ñenn ña dagg ay cari garab, lal ca yoon wa. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Ndiiraan ya ko jiitu ak ya ko topp a ngay xaacu naan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«<char style="w" lemma="Osaana:">Osaana</char>, cant ñeel na Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> bi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Na barke wàcc ci ki dikk ci turu Boroom bi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Osaana, na cant jibe béreb ya gëna kawe.»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yeesu nag agsi Yerusalem, dëkk ba bépp ne kër-kër ne këpp, ñu naan: «Kii moo di kan?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mbooloo ma ne leen: «Kii moo di Yonent bi, Yeesu mu Nasaret ca Galile.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dàq na jaaykat ya ca kër Yàlla ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu dugg ca kër Yàlla ga, daldi dàq mboolem ñay jaay aka jënd ca kër Yàlla ga. Mu dëpp taabali weccikati xaalis ya, ak tooguy jaaykati pitax ya. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Mu ne leen: «Bindees na ne: “Sama kër gi, kërug ñaan lees ko tudde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 56.7.</note>,” waaye yeen, moom ngeen def rawtub sàcc.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ca la ay gumba ak ay lafañ dikk ba ca moom, ca kër Yàlla ga, mu faj leen.<verse eid="MAT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />
    <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya, ak firikati yoonu Musaa ya nag gis kéemaan ya mu def, ak xale yay xaacu ca biir kër Yàlla ga, naan: «<char style="w" lemma="Osaana:">Osaana</char>, cant ñeel na Sëtub <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> bi!» Ñu daldi mer. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ñu ne Yeesu: «Dégg nga li ñii di wax?» Mu ne leen: «Waawaaw. Masuleena jàng li ñu ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">“Làmmiñu tuut-tànk, ba ci luy nàmp,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">ci ngay sàkkale sa bopp ag cant<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 8.3.</note>”?»<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ba loolu amee Yeesu bàyyikoo fa ñoom, génn dëkk ba, dem Betani, daldi fay fanaan.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu rëbb na garabu figg ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ba bët setee Yeesu di dellu ca dëkk ba. Ci biir loolu mu xiif. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Naka la séen ag figg fa feggook yoon wa, daldi cay dem, te taxul mu fekk ca dara lu dul ay xob doŋŋ. Mu ne figg ga: «Yàlla bu doom meññeeti fi yaw mukk!» Figg ga daldi wow ca saa sa.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Taalibe ya gis loolu, waaru, ne: «Nan la figg gi wowe ci saa si?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, su ngeen gëmee te baña am xel ñaar, dungeen yem ci def nii figg gi, waaye tund wii sax, bu ngeen ko noon: “Jógal tàbbiji géej,” loolooy am. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Te lépp lu ngeen sàkkoo ñaan gu ànd ak ngëm, dingeen ko am.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci sañ-sañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu dugg ca kër Yàlla ga. Naka lay jàngale, <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak magi askan wa dikk, laaj ko ne ko: «Lii ngay def, ci ban sañ-sañ nga koy defe? Ak ku la jox boobu sañ-sañ?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ma laaj leen man itam lenn; bu ngeen ma ko waxee, man itam ma wax leen ci ban sañ-sañ laay defe lii. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Sóobeb <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> ci ndox, fu mu jóge? Asamaan la ndigal la bawoo, am ci nit ñi?» Ñu diisoo ci seen biir, daldi ne: «Su nu nee: “Asamaan la ndigal la bawoo,” da nu naan: “Lu tax kon gëmuleen Yaxya?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Te su nu nee: “Ci nit ñi la bawoo,” booba mbooloo ma lanu ragal, ndax ñépp ab yonent lañu jàppe Yaxya.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ñu ne Yeesu: «Loolu xamunu ko.» Moom itam mu ne leen: «Man itam duma leen wax ci ban sañ-sañ laay defe lii.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuub moo gën të</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />«Waaye, luy seen xalaat ci lii? Nit a amoon ñaari doom. Mu dikk ca kenn ka, ne ko: “Doom, demal tey liggéeyi ca toolu reseñ ba.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mu ne ko: “Maa lànk,” waaye gannaaw gi, xelam yedd ko, mu dem. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Baay ba demati ca ka ca des, wax ko loolu. Mu ne ko: “Waaw, góor gi,” te demul.»<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />«Ana kan ci ñaar ñooñu moo def coobarey baayam?» Njiiti xeet wi ne: «Ku jëkk ki.» Yeesu nag ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, <char style="w" lemma="juutikat b-:">juutikat</char> yi ak gànc yi jiitu nañu leen ca nguurug Yàlla. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ndax <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> moo leen dikke yoonu njub, gëmuleen ko; waaye juutikat yi ak gànc yee ko gëm, ngeen di gis te taxul ngeen tuub, ba gëm ko.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beykat wor na boroom tool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Weneen léeb a ngi, dégluleen: «Boroom kër la woon bu jëmbat ab tóokëru reseñ, ñag ko, gas ca paxum nalukaayu reseñ, tabax ca taaxum wattukaay, ba noppi batale tóokër ba ay beykat, daldi tukki.<verse eid="MAT 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />«Ba wittum reseñ jubsee, mu yebal ay surgaam ca beykat ya, ngir jëlsi wàllam ca meññeef ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Beykat ya jàpp surga ya, kii ñu dóor ko, kee ñu rey ko, kale, ñu sànni ko ay doj. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Boroom kër ga yebalaat yeneen surga yu ëpp yu njëkk ya, beykat ya def leen noonu. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Mu mujj yebal doomam te naan: “Sama doom, dinañu ko rus.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Teewul ba beykat ya gisee doom ji, dañu ne ci seen biir: “Kii mooy donn; nanleen ko daldi rey, ba jagoo ndonoom.” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ci kaw loolu ñu jàpp ko, génne ko tóokër bi, rey ko.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />«Bu boroom tóokër bi dikkee, nu muy def beykat yooyu?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ñu ne ko: «Reyin wu ñaawa ñaaw lay rey ñu bon ñooñu, tóokëru reseñ ba, mu batale ko yeneen beykat yu ko jox wàllam ca meññeef ma, saa yu jotee.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Xanaa masuleena jàng lii ci Mbind mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Doj wi tabaxkat yi beddi woon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">moo mujj di doju koñu tabax bi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Lii de, fa Boroom bi la sottee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">nu gis ko, yéemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 118.22-23.</note>.”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Loolu moo tax ma ne leen dees na jële nguurug Yàlla ci yeen, jox ko xeet wuy meññal meññeef ma ca war. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Wii doj, képp ku ci dal, dammatoo, te ku mu dal, rajaxe la<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 8.14; <char style="bk">Dañeel</char> 2.34, 44.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ba <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya déggee léebi Yeesu yooyu, xam nañu xéll ne ñoom lay wax. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ñu di ko fexee jàpp nag, te ragal mbooloo ma, ndax ab yonent lañu ko jàppe woon.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Gàntal ab teraanga, dàq sa njariñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yeesu léebati leen, ne leen: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Nguurug asamaan dafa mel ni buur bu doon waajal céetalug doomam ju góor. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Mu yebal ay surgaam, ngir ñu jëli ña ñu woo ca bernde ja, te ñooñu bëgguñoo ñëw. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Mu yebalaat yeneen surga, ne: “Waxleen gan ñi ñu woo, ne leen: ‘Reer yi kat noppi na; samay nag ak sama juru yafal lañu rey, lépp sotti na, ñëwleen ci bernde ji.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Teewul ñu fénantal, dem seen yoon; kii ca toolam, kee cam njaayam, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />ñee jàpp surga ya, toroxal leen, rey leen.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />«Buur nag mer, daldi yónni gàngooram, ñu reyi bóomkat yooyu, lakk seenub dëkk. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ci kaw loolu mu ne surga ya: “Bernde ji de noppi na, waaye gan ñi ñu woo ñoo ko yeyoowul. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kon nag demleen ca selebe yoon ya, ku ngeen fa gis, woo ko ci céetal gi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Surga ya dem ca mbedd ya, daldi dajale mboolem ña ñu fa gis, ku baax ak ku bon, ba céet ga fees aki gan.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />«Ci kaw loolu buur bi duggsi, di xool gan ñi, daldi cay seetlu ku ag colam warul ci ag céet. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Buur ne ko: “Xarit, noo dugge fii, te soluloo col gi war ci ag céet?” Kooku ne cell. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Buur ne dag ya: “Yeewleen tànk yeek loxo yi, te ngeen sànni ko ca lëndëm gu tar ga ca biti. Foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ndax kat ñu bare lañu woo, waaye ñu néew lañu tànn.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sesaar ak wàllam, Yàlla ak wàllam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Booba la <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya diisooji ngir lal pexe mu ñu fiire Yeesu ci kàddoom.<verse eid="MAT 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ñu daldi yebal ci moom seeni taalibe ak ñi ànd ak farandooy Buur Erodd, ne ko: «Kilifa gi, xam nanu ne ku dëggu nga, te ci biir dëgg ngay jàngalee yoonu Yàlla. Ragaloo kenn it, ndax seetuloo ci jëmmi nit. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Kon nag wax nu sa xalaat: ndax yoon maye na ku fey Buur <char style="w" lemma="Sesaar:">Sesaar</char> ab galag am déet?»<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Teewul Yeesu xam seen mébét mu bon, daldi ne leen: «Lu ngeen may seetloo, jinigalkat yi? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Wonleen ma poset bi ñuy feye galag.» Ñu daldi ko jox benn posetub xaalis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">posetu xaalis bii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ab dinaar la woon, moo doon peyu bëccëgu lëmm.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Yeesu ne leen: «Nataal bii ak tur wii ci binde, kuy boroom?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ñu ne ko: «Buur Sesaar.» Mu ne leen: «Kon nag, yëfi Sesaar, joxleen ko Sesaar, te yëfi Yàlla, ngeen jox ko Yàlla.»<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ba ñu déggee loolu lañu waaru, daldi koy bàyyi, dem.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab Sadusen gëmul dee-dekki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Bésub keroog boobu <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> yi ne dee-dekki amul, ca lañu dikk ba ca moom. Ñu laaj ko ne ko: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Kilifa gi, Musaa noon na: “Su góor faatoo te amul doom, na ku mu bokkal waajur donn jabaram, ngir amal mbokkam ma dee, kuutaay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 25.5.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Léegi nag juróom ñaari góor a ngi woon ci sunu biir, ñu bokk ndey ak baay. Taaw ba am jabar ba faatu te amul doom, ba tax rakk ja donn jabar ja mu bàyyi gannaawam. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Tofo ba ak ñaareelu tofo ba def noonu, ba juróom ñaar ñépp dee. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Gannaaw gi, ndaw sa it dee. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Keroog ndekkite la nag, kan ci juróom ñaar ñi lay doon jabaram, gannaaw ñoom ñépp a ko jëloon?» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Seen njuumte moo di xamuleen Mbind mi, xamuleen manoorey Yàlla, <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />ndax keroog ndekkite la, kenn du am jabar mbaa jëkkër, waaye nit ñi dañuy mel ni malaaka yi ci asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ci wàllu ndekkite sax, xanaa jànguleen la leen Yàlla waxoon ne leen: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Maay Yàllay Ibraayma, di Yàllay Isaaxa, di Yàllay <char style="w" lemma="Yanqóoba:">Yanqóoba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 3.6.</note>”? Kon moom du ñi dee lay seen Yàlla, xanaa ñiy dund.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ba ca mbooloo ma déggee, dañoo waaru ca njàngaleem.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lenn ndigal moo tënk lépp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ba <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya yégee na Yeesu tëje gémmiñu <char style="w" lemma="Sadusen y-:">Sadusen</char> ya, dañoo féncoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ci kaw loolu kenn ca ñoom, ab xamkatub yoonu Musaa, di ko fexee fiir, laaj ko ne ko: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Kilifa gi, lan ndigal moo gëna màgg ci yoonu Musaa?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yeesu ne ko: «“Yàlla sa Boroom, nanga ko soppe sa léppi xol, ak sa léppi jëmm, ak sa léppi xel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 6.5.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Loolu mooy ndigal li gëna màgg, te moo jiitu. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ñaareel bi it yem ak moom, di: “Ni nga soppe sa bopp, nanga ko soppe sa moroom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sarxalkat yi</char> 19.18.</note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ci ñaari ndigal yooyu la mboolem yoonu Musaa, ak kàdduy yonent yi aju.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndax Almasi bi mooy sëtub Daawuda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya ñoo daje woon, Yeesu laaj leen, ne leen: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Luy seen xalaat ci <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, kan lay ab sëtam?» Ñu ne ko: «<char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char>.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ana kon nan la Daawuda mana waxe ci ni ko leeru <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi dikkale, ba di ko woowe “Sang bi”, naan:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Boroom bi daa wax sama Sang ne ko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">‘Toogeel sama ndijoor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">ba ma teg say noon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">fi sa suufu tànk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 110.1.</note>.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Gannaaw Daawuda moo woowe Almasi bi “Sang bi,” nu mu nekke ab sëtam?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Gannaaw loolu kenn manu koo tontu genn kàddu, te ca bés booba lañu dale, ñemeetuñu koo laaj dara.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu rëbb na jinigalkat ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu wax ak mbooloo ma ak taalibeem ya.<verse eid="MAT 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Mu ne: «Firikati yoon yi ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yi ñoo tooge jalu Musaa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Kon mboolem lu ñu leen wax, defleen ko te sàmm ko, waaye seeni jëf, buleen ko roy, ndax li ñuy wax duñu ko jëfe. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ay say yu diis gann lañuy takk, gàdduloo ko nit ñi, waaye ñoom ci seen bopp, seen baaraam sax duñu ko ci nangoo yékkati. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Mboolem lu ñu def, ngistal la. Ñooy réyal téere yi ñuy takk, guddal seen cimbir-cimbiri mbubb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">cimbir-cimbir: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yawut ya daan nañu takk ay cimbir-cimbir ci seeni cati mbubb, di ko fàttalikoo yoonu Yàlla. Njiiti yoon ya nag di tàkk ay cimbir-cimbir yu gudd, di ko mbubboo ag ragal Yàlla, gu ñu bëgg nit ñi nawe leen.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Ñoo taamu péetey teraanga ca bernde ya, ak toogu yu kaname ca jàngu ya, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />ak nuyoob wegeel ca pénc ma, ñu di leen woowe kilifa gi. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Waaye yeen buñu leen woowe “kilifa gi,” ndax kenn doŋŋ moo di seen kilifa, waaye yeen ñépp ay bokk ngeen. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />“Baay” it, buleen ko woowe kenn ci kaw suuf, ndax kenn doŋŋ a di seen baay, te mooy ka fa asamaan. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Buñu leen woowe it “njiit,” ndax kenn doŋŋ moo di seen njiit, te mooy <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Ki gëna màgg ci yeen mooy ki nangoo doon seen surga. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Waaye képp kuy réylu, dees na la toroxal, te ki toroxlu lees di yékkati.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13-14" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoonu Musaa yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi, naaféq yi! Yeenay tëjal nit ñi nguurug asamaan. Yeen ci seen bopp dugguleen, te bàyyiwuleen ñi bëgga dugg, ñu dugg.<verse eid="MAT 23:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoon yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi! Yeena ngi wër géej ak jéeri, ngir tuubloo kenn doŋŋ, te bu tuubee ngeen def ko nitu sawara ku leen yées ñaari yoon.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen njiit yu gumba yi! Yeena ne: “Ku giñe kër Yàlla gi, dara waru la, waaye ku giñe wurusu kër Yàlla gi, tënku nga.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Dof yu gumba yi! Ana lu ci gëna màgg, wurus wi, am kër Yàlla gi tax wurus wi sell? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Ngeen neeti: “Ku giñe <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaay</char> bi ci kër Yàlla gi, dara toppu la, waaye ku giñ ci sarax yi ci kaw sarxalukaay bi, tënku nga.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Yeena diy gumba! Ana lu ci gëna màgg, sarax si, am sarxalukaay bi tax sarax si sell? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ku giñe sarxalukaay bi kay, sarxalukaay bi, ak li ci kawam lépp nga giñe. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Ku giñe kër Yàlla gi, giñe nga kër Yàlla gi, giñe ki ko dëkke. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Ku giñe asamaan it, giñe nga ngànguney Yàlla, giñe Yàlla mi ci toog.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoon yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi! Xobi naana, ak safal yu mel ni anet ak kumin, yeena ngi ciy génne cérub fukkeel, ngir asaka, tey sofental njubte ak yërmande ak ngëm. Lii de war na leen, waaye lee it, waruleen koo sofental. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Njiit yu gumba yi! Seggkati wallax-njaanée, te giléem, ngeen wann!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoon yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi! Yeenay raxas bitib kaas bi, ak ndab li, feek li fees kaas baa ngi jóge ci càcc ak ŋàppaaral. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Farisen bu gumba bi! Njëkkala raxas biir kaas bi ba mu set, ba biti bi itam mana set.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoon yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi! Yeena ngi mel ni bàmmeel yu ñu weexal. Rafet melow biti, te ca biir fees ak yaxi néew ak sobe su nekk. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Noonu rekk ngeen mel yeen itam, di niru nit ñi ñu jub, te seen biir xol feese jikkoy jinigal ak ndëngte.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />«Wóoy ngalla yeen firikati yoon yi ak Farisen yi, jinigalkat yi! Yeenay tabax bàmmeeli yonent yi, di rafetal béreb ya ñu denc aji jub ñi, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />te naan: “Su nu fekke woon sunu jamonoy maam ya, dunu ànd ak ñoom, di tuur deretu yonent yi.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Seen wax jooju nag ngeen seedeele seen bopp ne yeenay doomi ña reyoon yonent ya. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Yeen kay, feesalleen seen ndabu maam ya rekk! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Jaan yee, njurum céebi mi! Ana nu ngeen di rëcce mbugalu sawara? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Loolu moo tax kat man, ma yebal ci yeen ay yonent ak boroomi xam-xam ak firikati yoon. Ñii ngeen rey, ñee ngeen daaj leen ci bant, ñale ngeen caw leen ay yar ci seeni jàngu, di leen bunduxataal ci dëkkoo dëkk. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Moo leen tax di këppoo mboolem deretu aji jub ji ñu tuur ci àddina, dale ko ca deretu Abel mu jub ma, ba ca deretu Sàkkaryaa doomu Barakiya ma ñu bóom ca diggante kërug jaamookaay ga ak sarxalukaay ba. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Maa leen ko wax déy, loolu lépp ay dikkal niti tey jii.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Yerusalem, Yerusalem, yaw miy bóom yonent yi, di sànni ay doj ñi ñu yebal ci yaw, ba ñu dee, ñaata yoon laa namma boole say doom, uuf ni ganaar di uufe ay cuujam, te nanguwuloo? <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Mu ngoog, waccees na laak sa kër nag, mu gental, <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />nde maa la ne doo ma gisati ba keroog nga naa: “Na barke wàcc ci ki dikk ci turu Boroom bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 118.26.</note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem tas, Doomu nit ki délsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Naka la Yeesuy génne ca kër Yàlla ga, ay taalibeem dikk, joxoñ ko tabaxi kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Teewul mu àddu, ne leen: «Gis ngeen lii lépp? Maa leen ko wax déy, doj wu tege ciw doj du dese fii te tasul.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Gannaaw gi, ba Yeesu toogee ca kaw <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya, taalibeem yaa dikk, wax ak moom, ñook moom doŋŋ, ne ko: «Wax nu kañ la loolu di am, ak luy doonub takk buy xamle sam peeñ, ak tukkitel àddina?»<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yeesu ne leen: «Moytuleen, ba kenn du leen nax, <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />ndax ñu bareey dikk, tuddoo sama tur, naan: “Maa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi,” te ñu bare lañuy nax. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Dingeen dégg ay xare ak coowi xare; waaye moytuleena tiit, ndax fàww loolu am, waaye du doonagum muj ga. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Aw xeet dina jógal aw xeet, am réew jógal am réew. Ay xiif ak yëngu-yënguy suuf dina dikke fu bare. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Waaye loolu lépp ndoortel mititu mat lay doon. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Bu boobaa dees na leen teg ciy loxo, ngir ñu mitital leen, rey leen; mbañeel la leen xeet yépp di won ndax sama tur. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ca la ñu bare di xàcc, di worante aka bañante. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Te itam yonenti caaxaan yu bareey feeñ, di nax ñu bare. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ndëngte it dina law ba cofeelu nit ñu bare day giim. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Waaye ku muñ ba muj ga, kooku dina mucc. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ci kaw loolu bii xibaaru jàmm bu nguurug Yàlla, dees na ko biral ci àddina sépp, ngir mu doon kàddug seede, ñeel xeet yépp. Su boobaa nag muj ga dikk.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Moo tax, “lu siblu luy jur yàqute” li Yonent Yàlla Dañeel doon wax<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Dañeel</char> 9.27; 11.31; 12.11.</note>, bu ngeen ko gisee mu taxaw ci <char style="w" lemma="néeg bu sell b-:">néeg bu sell</char> bi, yaw miy jàng, teewlul, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />su boobaa ña mu fekk ca diiwaanu Yude, nañu daw jëm kaw tund ya; <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />ku mu fekk ci kaw am taax, bul wàcc ngir jëli lenn ca biir; <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />ku mu fekk ca tool ba, bul dellu ca kër ga, di jëli sa mbubb. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Wóoy ngalla jigéeni wérul ña, ak ñay nàmpal ca bés yooyu! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ñaanleen nag seen gàddaay baña yemook jamonoy seddaayu lolli, mbaa <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char>, <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />ndax ca la coono bu réy di am, coono bu masula am, ba àddina sosoo ak tey, te dootul am mukk. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Te bu ñu wàññiwul woon diir boobu, kenn du mucc, waaye ñi ñu tànn ñoo tax ñu wàññi janti coono ya.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />«Booba nag, ku leen ne: “Xoolal, Almasi baa ngi nii,” mbaa: “Ma nga nale,” buleen ko gëm, <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />ndax ay almasiy caaxaan ak yonenti caaxaan ñooy feeñ, di jëfe ay firnde yu réy, aki kéemaan, ngir nax ñi ñu tànn, ñoom itam, ndegam man naa nekk. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mu ngoog, wax naa leen ko ba noppi.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Kon bu ñu leen nee: “Ma ngoogu ca àll ba,” buleen dem, te bu ñu leen nee: “Mu ngii làqu ci biir néeg,” buleen ko gëm, <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />ndax ni melax di tàkke penku, lerax ba sowu, noonu la <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki di feeñe. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Fu médd nekk, fa la tan yay daje.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Gannaaw coonob fan yooyu nag,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">“jant bi day daldi lëndëm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">weer wi fey ag leeram;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">biddiiw yi xàwweekoo asamaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">dooley asamaan sàqi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Ca la màndargam Doomu nit ki di feeñ fa asamaan. Bu boobaa xeeti àddina yépp dinañu tiislu te dinañu gis Doomu nit ki di ñëw ci kaw niir yi, ànd ak manoore ak daraja ju réy. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Ci kaw loolu coowal liit gu xumb lay yebale ay malaakaam, ñu dajalee ay tànnéefam fa ñeenti jëmuy ngelaw li, dale ko ca catu asamaan lii ba ca cat lee.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Yeesu teg ca ne: «Jàngatleen misaalu garabu figg. Ag figg, bu bànqaas ya duyee, xob ya di sëq, ngeen xam ne nawet jubsi na. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Bu ngeen gisee xew-xew yooyu yépp sotti, noonu itam ngeen di xame ne bés bi jubsi na, ba agsi ci bunt bi sax. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Maa leen ko wax déy, niti tey jii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.34 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">niti tey jii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Màrk</char> 8.38.</note> duñu wéy mukk te loolu lépp sottiwul. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Asamaan ak suuf dina wees, waaye samay wax du wees mukk.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yàlla rekk moo xam bés ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Waaye bés boobu ak waxtu wa, kenn xamu ko; du malaaka ya fa asamaan, du Doom ji, xanaa Baay bi doŋŋ. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Na woon ca jamonoy Nóoyin, noonu lay deme, bu <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki di feeñ. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ndaxte jant ya jiitu mbënn ma, nit ñaa nga doon lekk aka naan, di takk aka maye jabar, ba bés ba Nóoyin duggee ca gaal ga. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Yéguñu woon dara, ba kera mbënn ma dikk, buub ñépp. Noonu doŋŋ lay deme bu Doomu nit ki feeñee.<verse eid="MAT 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />«Bu boobaa ñaar ay nekk ca tool ba, kenn ki, ñu yóbbu ko, ka ca des, ñu bàyyi ko. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ñaari jigéen di wolandoo ca wolukaay ba, ñu yóbbu kenn, bàyyi ka ca des. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Kon nag teewluleen, ndax kat xamuleen ban bés la seenub sang di dikk. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Waaye lenn de, xamleen ko: boroom kër, su xamoon wan waxtuw guddi la ab sàcc di ñëw, kon dina teewlu te du ko bàyyi moos, mu dàjjiy dugg këram. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Moo tax yeen itam waajleen ba jekk, ndax waxtu wu ngeen foogul, ci la Doomu nit ki di ñëw.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Ana kan nag mooy surga bu wóor te muus, ba njaatigeem batale ko surgay këram, ngir mu di leen jox ab dund ca ba muy jot? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ndokkalee surga bu njaatigeem dikk, fekk ko muy doxale noonu. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Maa leen ko wax déy, alalam jépp la ko njaatige la di far dénk. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Waaye su surga bu bon ba nee ci xelam: “Sama njaatige dikkagul léegi,” <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />ba tax mu tàmbalee dóor ay bokki surgaam, di lekk aka naanandoo ak màndikat ya, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />su boobaa njaatige laay dikk bés bu mu ko séenuwul ak waxtu wu mu foogul, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />mbugal ko ba daggat ko, sédd ko ci añub jinigalkat yi. Foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Séentu sab sang laaj na teewlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Su boobaa nguurug asamaan day mel ni fukki janq yu fab seeni làmp, génn, gatanduji boroom séet, <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />juróom ña nag di ñu dofe, te juróom ña ca des di ñu muus. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ñu dofe ña fab seeni làmp, te jotuñoo fàgguwaale ag diw; <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />ña muus ñoom, fàgguwaale ag diw ci seeni njaq, booleek seeni làmp. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Boroom séet ba nag guddee, ñépp gëmmeentu, bay nelaw.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />«Ba guddi ga xaajee, coow la jib: “Boroom séet baa ngoog, génnleen, gatandu ko.” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Janq ja jépp yewwu, daldi waajal seeni làmp. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Ñu dofe ña ne ña muus: “Mayleen nu ci seenug diw, sunuy làmp a ngi fey.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Ñu muus ña ne leen: “Déet, lu ko moy du nu am lu nu doy, nook yeen. Demleen kay jëndali seen bopp fa muy jaaye!”<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />«Naka lañu dem jëndi, boroom séet ba agsi. Ci kaw loolu ña mu fekk noppi, ànd ak boroom séet ba, dugg ca néegu bernde ja, bunt ba daldi tëje. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Gannaaw loolu janq ja ca des dikk, ne: “Sang bi, Sang bi, ubbil nu!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Mu ne leen: “Aylayéwén laa leen wax, xawma leen.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />«Teewluleen boog, nde xamuleen bés ba, mbaa waxtu wa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndénkaane aw sas la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Nguurug Yàlla dafa mel ni kuy waaja tukki, daldi woo ay surgaam, batale leen alalam. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kii, mu dénk ko juróomi milyoŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">juróomi milyoŋ: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maanaam juróomi talaŋ. Seetal </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci Leeral yi.</char></note>; kee, ñaar; ka ca des, benn, ku nekk ak la mu àttan. Ci kaw loolu, mu daldi tukki. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />«Ka jot juróomi milyoŋ ya nag daldi dem, di ca jula, ba amaat yeneen juróom. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ka jot ñaar it def noonu, ba amaat yeneen ñaar. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ka jot benn milyoŋ moom dem gas ca suuf, làq fa xaalisu njaatigeem.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Gannaaw diir bu yàgg njaatigeb surga ya délsi, daldi bokk xayma ak ñoom ni alalam tolloo. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Ci kaw loolu ka jotoon juróomi milyoŋ dikk, indaale yeneen juróom, ne ko: “Sang bi, juróomi milyoŋ nga ma dénkoon; yeneen juróom yii laa ci am.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Njaatigeem ne ko: “Jaaraamaa, surga bu baax bi te wóor. Gannaaw ci lu tuut nga wóore, lu bare laa lay dénk. Kaay nag nu bokk bége.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Ka jotoon ñaari milyoŋ it dikk, ne ko: “Sang bi, ñaari milyoŋ nga ma dénkoon, yeneen ñaar yii laa ci am.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Njaatige la ne ko: “Jaaraamaa, surga bu baax bi te wóor. Gannaaw ci lu tuut nga wóore nag, lu bare laa lay dénk. Kaay nag nu bokk bége.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />«Ka jotoon benn milyoŋ it dikk, ne ko: “Sang bi, xamoon naa ne nit ku néeg nga; dangay dajale loo jiwuloon, di góob loo faruwuloon. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Moo tax ma ragal, ba dem gas ca suuf, làq ca sab milyoŋ. Mu ngii, fabal sa alal.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Njaatige la nag ne ko: “Surga bu bon bi te yaafus! Xamoon nga ne damay dajale lu ma jiwuloon, di góob lu ma faruwuloon. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Kon waroon ngaa yóbbu sama xaalis ca denckati xaalis ya, ba bu ma dikkee, jot sama milyoŋ, boole ca tonoom. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Nanguleen nag xaalis bi ci moom, te jox ko boroom fukki milyoŋ yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ndaxte képp ku am, dees na ko dolli, ba mu barele, waaye ku amul, la mu am as néew sax, dees na ko nangu. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Surga bu ñàkk njariñ bii nag, sànnileen ko ca lëndëm gu tar ga ca biti. Foofa lees di jooye aka yéyoo ndax mitit.”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Almasi bi mooy àtte àddina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Keroog bu <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki dikkee darajaam nag, ànd ak mboolem malaaka yi, mooy toog ci ngànguneem lu darajawu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Dañeel</char> 7.13-14.</note>, <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />mboolem xeet yi lees di dajale fi kanamam, te mooy xàjjaatle ñii ak ñee, ni ab sàmm di xàjjaatlee ay xar aki bëy, <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />te mooy teg xar yi fi ndijooram; bëy yi, fa càmmoñam.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />«Ca la buur bay wax ñi ci ndijooram ne leen: “Yeen ñi sama Baay barkeel, dikkleen jël nguur gi ñu leen waajalaloon ba àddina sosoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ndaxte ba ma xiifee, yeena ma leel; ma mar, ngeen nàndal ma; ma dib doxandéem, ngeen fat ma; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />ma rafle, ngeen wodd ma; ma wopp, ngeen toppatoo ma; ñu tëj ma, ngeen seetsi ma.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Su ko defee boroom njekk yi ne ko: “Sang bi, kañ lanu la gis, nga xiif, nu leel la; mbaa nga mar, nu nàndal la? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ak kañ lanu la gis, nga dib doxandéem, nu fat la; mbaa nga rafle, nu wodd la? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ak itam kañ lanu la gis, nga wopp mbaa ñu tëj la, nu seetsi la?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Bu loolu amee buur ba ne leen: “Maa leen ko wax déy, lu ngeen ci defal kenn ci ñi gëna tuut ci sama bokk yii, man ngeen ko defal.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Gannaaw loolu, ña fa càmmoñam la naan: “Yeen ñi alku nag, xiddileen ma, te tàbbiji sawara su dul fey, fa ñu waajalal <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> aki malaakaam. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ndaxte ba ma xiifee, leeluleen ma, ba ma maree, nàndaluleen ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ba ma dee ab doxandéem, fatuleen ma; ba ma raflee, wodduleen ma; ba ma woppee, ak ba ñu ma tëjee it, seetsiwuleen ma.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Su ko defee ñoom itam ñu ne ko: “Sang bi, kañ lanu la gis, nga xiif, mbaa nga mar, mbaa nga dib doxandéem, mbaa nga rafle, mbaa nga wopp, mbaa ñu tëj la, te fajunu sa soxla?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Ca la leen di wax ne leen: “Maa leen ko wax déy, lu ngeen ci defalul kenn ci ñi gëna tuut, man ngeen ko defalul.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ñooña daldi séddooji mbugal mu sax dàkk, boroom njekk yi nag séddooji texe gu sax dàkk.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Njiiti yoon yi fexeel nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ba Yeesu daaneelee mboolem kàddu yooyu, da ne ay taalibeem: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Xam ngeen ne ñaari fan a des ci <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char>. Ca lañuy wor <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, daaj ko ci bant.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Booba nag <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak magi askan wa ña nga daje ca màkkaanu sarxalkat bu mag, ba ñuy wax Kayif. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ci biir loolu ñu gise, ngir nu ñu sàcce ba jàpp Yeesu, reylu ko. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Teewul nag ñu ne: «Bumu doon ci bésu màggal bi, lu ko moy askan wi yëngu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jigéen teral na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yeesu nag ma nga woon dëkk ba ñuy wax Betani ca kër Simoŋ <char style="w" lemma="gaana:">gaana</char> ga. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />As ndaw dikk, yor njaqal doju albatar lu def lajkoloñ gu jafe. Ndaw sa fekk Yeesu ca ndab la, muy lekk, mu sotti ko ca boppam. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Taalibe ya nag gis ca, ñaawlu ko ne: «Ana lu waral yàq gii? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Maneesoon naa jaaye lii lu bare, jox xaalis bi néew-doole yi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yeesu nag xam la ñu wax, ne leen: «Lu ngeen di sonale ndaw si? Jëf ju rafet la ma defal! <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Néew-doole yi de, dingeen ci am ñu nekk ak yeen ba fàww. Waaye man de, amuleen ma ba fàww. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Sotti gi ndaw si sotti diw gi ci sama kaw, samab rob la koy waajale. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Maa leen ko wax déy, li ndaw sii def, fépp fu ñuy yéeneji ëllëg xibaaru jàmm bii ci àddina sépp, dees na ko fa nettalee, di ko fàttalikoo jëmmu ndaw si.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wor na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Booba la waa ju ñuy wax Yuda Iskaryo, kenn ca Fukk ñaak ñaar, dem ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ne leen: «Lan ngeen ma mana jox, ngir ma teg Yeesu ci seeni loxo?» Ñu waññal ko fanweeri poseti xaalis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 11.12-13.</note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ca la Yuda dale wut yoon wu mu jekkoo Yeesu, ba wor ko.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Reerub tàggatoo jot na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ca bés ba njëkk ca <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalug ayu bésu Mburu mu amul lawiir</char> nag<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ci Yawut yi, bés bu nekk, ci tàkkusaan lay tàmbali.</char></note>, taalibe yaa dikk ne Yeesu: «Foo bëgg nu waajalal la fa reeru <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">bésub Mucc</char> bi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yeesu ne leen: «Demleen ca dëkk ba, te ngeen àgg ba ca diw, ne ko: “Kilifa gi nee: Sama bés dëgmal na; ci yaw nag laay màggalsee bésub Mucc bi, maak samay taalibe.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Taalibe ya def la leen Yeesu sant, daldi waajal reeru bésub Mucc ba.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ba jant sowee, Yeesu dikk di reersi, moom ak Fukk ñaak ñaar. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Naka lañuy lekk, mu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, kenn ci yeen moo may wor.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Taalibe ya am tiis lool; ku nekk daldi ne ko: «Mbaa du man a, Sang bi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ki yebandoo ak man loxoom ci ndab li, kooku moo may wor. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" /><char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> kaa ngi dem moos, noonee ñu ko binde woon, waaye wóoy ngalla ki pexe mi ñu wore Doomu nit ki di jaare! Kooka de, bañoona juddu sax moo doon gën ci moom.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda, mi ko nara wor, ne ko: «Mbaa du man a, Kilifa gi?» Yeesu ne ko: «Yaa ko wax.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Naka ñuy lekk nag, Yeesu jël mburu, yékkati kàddug cant, dagg, jox taalibe ya. Mu ne leen: «Jëlleen lekk, lii sama yaram la.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Mu teg ca jël ab kaas, yékkati kàddug cant, jox leen ko, ne leen: «Naanleen ci, yeen ñépp, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />ndax lii mooy sama deret, ji fas <char style="w" lemma="kóllëre g-:">kóllëre</char> gi, te nara tuurul ñépp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baat bii man naa tekki «ñu bare», waaye ci làkku yawut waxin la: fii «ñépp» lay wund. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi 53.12</char> ak ci <char style="bk">1.Timote</char> 2.6.</note> ngir njéggalug bàkkaar. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Maa leen ko wax, gannaaw-si-tey dootuma naan mukk ndoxum reseñ mii, ba kera may naan, maak yeen, ndoxum reseñ mu bees ca sama nguurug Baay.»<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ba loolu amee ñu yékkati galanu cant, daldi génn jëm <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Booba la leen Yeesu ne: «Yeen ñépp ay dellu gannaaw ndax man, guddig tey jii, ndax bindees na ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">“Maay dóor sàmm bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">xar yi tasaaroo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 13.7.</note>.”<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Waaye bu ma dekkee, dinaa leen jiituji fa Galile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piyeer nag àddu ne ko: «Bu ñépp dellu woon gannaaw ndax yaw, man duma dellu gannaaw mukk.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maa la ko wax déy, guddig tey jii, bala ganaar a sab, dinga ma jàmbu ñetti yoon.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piyeer ne ko: «Su ma naree ànd ak yaw dee sax, duma la jàmbu mukk.» Taalibe ya ca des yépp waxe noonu, ñoom itam.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu ñaan na ci biir tiis wu réy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ca la Yeesu ànd ak ñoom ba béreb ba ñuy wax Setsemane, mu ne taalibe ya: «Toogleen fii, ma dem fale, ba ñaani fa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ci kaw loolu mu ànd ak Piyeer ak ñaari doomi Sebede, aw tiis ak njàqare nag daldi koy jàpp. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ca la leen ne: «Tiis wu réy la sama xol fees, ba may bëgga dee! Toogleen fii, te ngeen ànd ak man ci teewlu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ba loolu amee, Yeesu dox ba sore leen tuuti, ne gurub sukk, dëpp jëëm fa suuf. Mu ñaan ne: «Sama Baay, bu manee am, bii kaas bu fees ak wextanu coono, ngalla teggil ma ko! Moona, bumuy sama coobare nag, waaye yaw, na sa coobare am.»<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Gannaaw loolu mu délsi, fekk taalibe ya di nelaw. Mu ne Piyeer: «Wenn waxtu doŋŋ, amuleen dooley teewloondoo kook man? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Teewluleen te ñaan, ngir baña tàbbi cig fiir. Xolub nit kat yebu na, yaram see néew doole.» <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yeesu delluwaat, ba nee, ñaareel bi yoon, daldi ñaan ne: «Sama Baay, ndegam lii manu maa teggi ba duma ko naan, na sa coobare am.» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Mu délsiwaat, fekk leen ñuy nelaw, manatuñoo xippi, ndax ngëmment. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Mu bàyyikoo ca ñoom, demati ba nee ñetteel bi yoon, daldi dellu ca genn kàddug ñaan googa.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Gannaaw gi, mu délsiwaat ca taalibe ya ne leen: «Yeena ngi nelaw, di noppalu ba tey? Waxtu waa ngii dëgmal, ci lañuy teg <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki ci loxoy bàkkaarkat yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Jógleen nu dem, ki may wor a ngi nii.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jàpp nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Naka la Yeesu di wax, daaneelagul, Yuda, kenn ca Fukk ñaak ñaar, jekki agsi, ànd ak gàngoor gu takku, jóge ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak magi askan wa. Ña nga gànnaayoo ay saamar aki njur. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Fekk na workat ba jox leen ab tegtal, ne leen: «Ki may fóon, kooku la; jàppleen ko.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Mu dikk ba ci Yeesu, ne ko: «Jàmm nga am, Kilifa gi,» daldi ko fóon. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yeesu ne ko: «Xarit, li la indi, def ko.» Ca lañu ko ne taral, jàpp ko.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ba loolu amee kenn ca ña ànd ak Yeesu ne yóot bocci saamaram, caw ko surgab sarxalkat bu mag ba, njoof nopp ba. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Teewul Yeesu ne ko: «Dellool sa saamar ci mbaram, ndax képp ku bocci saamar, saamar lay deewe. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Defe nga ne manumaa woo sama Baay wall, mu yónnee ma ci saa si lu ëpp fukki gàngoori malaaka ak ñaar? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Waaye kon nu Mbind miy ame te mu indi ne fàww mu deme noonu?»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Ca waxtu woowa la Yeesu ne mbooloo ma: «Jàppsi ma doŋŋ a leen taxa dikkey saamar aki njur, mel ni ñuy topp ab fippukat. Moona bés bu nekk maa nga daan toog ca kër Yàlla ga, di jàngale, te jàppuleen ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Waaye lii lépp daa am ngir sottal Bindi yonent yi.» Ci kaw loolu taalibe yépp daw, wacc ko.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu jànkoonte na ak àttekat ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ña jàpp Yeesu nag yóbbu ko kër Kayif, <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, fa firikati yoonu Musaa ya ak magi askan wa daje. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piyeer moom, yoxal Yeesu lu sore, topp ca gannaawam, ba ca ëttu sarxalkat bu mag ba; mu dugg, toog ak wattukat ya, di seet nu mbir may mujje.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Sarxalkat yu mag yaak mboolem <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekati</char> Yawut ya nag di wut fen yu nit seedeel Yeesu, ba ñu man koo reylu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />te amuñu ko, doonte ay seedey fen-kat yu baree dikk. Ñaar nag mujj dikk, ne: <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />«Kii de moo noon: “Man namaa toj kër Yàlla gi, tabaxaat ko ci ñetti fan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yowaan</char> 2.19-22.</note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Ba mu ko defee sarxalkat bu mag ba jóg ne ko: «Doo tontu dara ci li la ñii tuumaal?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Yeesu ne cell. Sarxalkat bu mag ba ne ko: «Giñloo naa la ci Yàlla jiy dund, ngir nga wax nu, ndax yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yeesu ne ko: «Yaa ko wax. Te it, maa leen ne gannaaw-si-tey dingeen gis <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki toog ci ndijooru Boroom Kàttan gi, te dingeen ko gis ci kaw niir yi, muy ñëw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 110.1; <char style="bk">Dañeel</char> 7.13-14.</note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ca la sarxalkat bu mag ba ne tareet yérey boppam, ndax mer. Mu ne: «Diir na Yàlla mbagg, lu nu doyeeti seede? Yeena dégg ni mu diire Yàlla mbagg! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Lu ngeen ci xam nag?» Ñu ne: «Dee mooy àtteem!»<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ca lañu ko tifli ci kanam, dóor ko ay këmëx. Ñeneen ña talaata ko, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />te naan ko: «Almasée, waxal nu kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> boog, ana ku la dóor?»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer jàmbu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ci biir loolu Piyeer a nga toogoon ca biti, ca ëtt ba. Ab surga bu jigéen dikk ba ca moom, ne ko: «Yaw itam yaak Yeesum Galilee àndoon.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Teewul Piyeer miim ko ci kanam ñépp ne ko: «Xawma li ngay wax.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Gannaaw gi, Piyeer génn jëm ca bunt ba, beneen surga bu jigéen gis ko, ne ña fa nekkoon: «Kii mook Yeesum Nasaret a àndoon.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Teewul Piyeer dellu miim ko ci kaw ngiñ, ne: «Xawma kooku!»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Nes tuut ña fa taxawoon dikk ne Piyeer: «Yaw itam kay ci ñoom nga bokk, sa waxin a la feeñal.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ca la tàmbalee waat aka giñ, ne: «Ki ngeen di wax, man xawma ko.» Ca saa sa ganaar sab. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Piyeer daldi fàttaliku la Yeesu waxoon ne: «Bala ganaar a sab, dinga ma jàmbu ñetti yoon.» Mu génn nag, di jooy jooy yu metti.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda réccu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ca suba teel mboolem <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak magi askan wa féncoo, ngir teg Yeesu àtteb dee. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ñu yeew ko, yóbbu, jébbal ko <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> boroom réew ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda ma wor Yeesu nag, ba mu gisee na ñu tege Yeesu àtteb dee, ca la réccu, daldi delloo fanweeri poseti xaalis ya ca sarxalkat yu mag ya ak magi askan wa. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Mu ne: «Bàkkaar naa ba ma woree jàmbur bu deful dara, ñu tuur deretam.» Ñu ne ko: «Lu ciy sunu yoon? Yaa xam!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Ba mu ko defee Yuda sànni xaalis ba ca kër Yàlla ga, jóge fa, dem, wékk boppam, xaru.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Sarxalkat yu mag ya nag for xaalis ba, ne: «Yoon mayewul ku def xaalis bi ci dencukaayu kër Yàlla gi, ndax peyug deret la.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Gannaaw ba ñu ca diisoo, ab toolu defarkatu ndaa lañu jënd ca xaalis ba, ngir di fa suul doxandéem yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Loolu moo tax Toolu deret lañu ko woowe ba tey ji. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Noonu la kàddu ga jottalikoo woon ci Yonent Yàlla Yeremi sottee. Mooy ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:9">«Jël nañu fanweeri dogi xaalis ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:9">muy njëgu nit ka ñu xayma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:9">te <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> di ñi ko xayma,<verse eid="MAT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />weccee ko toolu tabaxkatu ndaa ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:10">na ma ko Boroom bi sante woon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yeremi</char> 18.2-3; 19.1-2; 32.6-15; <char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 11.12-13.</note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu taxaw na fa kanam Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yeesu nag taxaw ca kanam <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> boroom réew ma. Boroom réew ma laaj ko, ne ko: «Yaw yaa di buurub Yawut yi?» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Yeesu ne ko: «Yaa ko wax.» Teewul ba ko <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak magi askan wa di tuumaal, tontuwu ca. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ca la ko Pilaat ne: «Xanaa dégguloo li ñu lay jiiñ lépp?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Yeesu nag tontuwu ko ci lenn, ba tax boroom réew ma jaaxle lool.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Fekk na màggal gu nekkaan, boroom réew ma daan na may askan wa, ñu tànn ca ña ñu tëj kaso, kenn nit ku ñu bëgg, mu bàyyi kooka. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Booba amoon na ku ñu tëj ca kaso ba, te muy ku siiw ku ñuy wax Barabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ba ñu dajee nag, Pilaat ne leen: «Kan ngeen bëgg, ma bàyyi ko, Yeesu Barabas, am Yeesu mi ñuy wax <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Booba xam na ne kiñaan a tax ñu jàpplu Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Naka la Pilaat toog ca jalu àttekaay ba, soxnaam yeble ca moom ne ko: «Bul dugg ci mbiri ku jub kooku, ndax tey sonn naa lool ci biir gént ndax moom.» <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Teewul sarxalkat yu mag ya ak magi askan wa xiirtal mbooloo ma, ngir ñu ñaan ñu bàyyi Barabas te reylu Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Boroom réew ma nag ne leen: «Kan ci ñaar ñii ngeen bëgg, ma bàyyil leen ko?» Ñu ne ko: «Barabas.» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilaat ne leen: «Nu may def Yeesu, mi ñuy wax Almasi bi nag?» Ñépp ne ko: «Daaj ko ci bant!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Boroom réew ma ne leen: «Lu tax? Ana lu bon lu mu def?» Teewul ñu gëna xaacooti, ne: «Daajal ci bant!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilaat nag gis ne amu ca pexe, te coow lu réy a cay topp, mu sàkk ndox, raxas ay loxoom ca kanam mbooloo ma, daldi ne: «Set naa wecc ci deretu kii. Yeenay seet.» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mbooloo mépp àddoondoo, ne: «Na nu deretam dal, nook sunuy doom.»<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Booba la leen Pilaat bàyyil Barabas, Yeesu moom, mu cawlu ko ay kàcciri, ba noppi teg ko ciy loxo, ngir ñu daaj ko ci bant.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Takk-der ya ñaawal nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ba mu ko defee takk-deri boroom réew ma yóbbu Yeesu kër buur, ñu daldi woo gàngoor ga gépp ca kawam. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Gannaaw loolu ñu futti ko, solal ko mbubb mu xonq curr, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />teg ci boppam <char style="w" lemma="kaala g-:">kaala</char> gu ñu ràbbe ay dég, ba noppi teg aw yet ci loxol ndijooram. Ñu sukk ci kanamam, di ko ñaawal, naan: «Buuru Yawut yée, guddaluw fan!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ci kaw loolu ñu di ko tifli, fab yet wa, di ko dóor ci bopp. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ba ñu ko ñaawalee ba noppi, dañoo summi mbubb ma, solal ko ay yéreem, door koo yóbbu, ngir ñu daaj ko ci bant.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daaj nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ba ñu génnee, jenn waay ju ñuy wax Simoŋ te dëkk Siren<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.32 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Siren, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ab dëkk la bu nekkoon ci tefesu bëj-gànnaaru Afrig te féete Misra sowu.</char></note> lañu dajeel; moom lañu gàdduloo bant ba ñu daaj Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ñu dem ca béreb ba ñuy wax Golgota, muy firi bérebu Kaaŋu bopp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.33 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">bérebu Kaaŋu bopp </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy tund wu nirook kaaŋu bopp.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Ci kaw loolu ñu may ko biiñ bu ñu jaxaseek wextan, ngir mu naan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 69.22.</note>. Teewul ba mu ca ñamee, nanguwu koo naan.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ba loolu amee ñu daaj Yeesu ca bant ba, daldi tegoo bant ay yéreem, séddoo ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 22.19.</note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ba loolu wéyee ñu toog fa, di ko wattu. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Fa féete boppam kaw nag, ñu teg fa lu ñu bind tuumaam ja ko daanlu, mbind ma ne: «Kii mooy Yeesu, buurub Yawut yi.»<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Ca lañu daajaale ak Yeesu ñaari fippukat ya, kii ci ndijooram, kee ca càmmoñam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 53.12.</note>.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Ña fa jaare nag di ko saaga aka wëcc bopp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 22.7-8.</note>, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />naan: «Acam, yaw miy toj kër Yàlla gi, tabaxaat ko ci ñetti fan, musalal sa bopp boog; gannaaw yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, wàccal bant bi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" /><char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya it naka noonu, ñook firikati yoonu Musaa ya ak magi askan wa. Ñu di ko ñaawal, naan: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Moom day musle te manul musal sax boppam! Mooy buurub Israayil, na wàcc bant bi léegi kay, nu gëm ko. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Gannaaw Yàlla la wóolu, na ko Yàlla daldi musal, su ko soobee, ndegam nee naay: “Maay Doomu Yàlla.”» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Fippukat ya ñu daajaale ak moom itam, di ko tifaare ay saaga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu saay na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />La tàmbalee fukki waxtu ak ñaar ca bëccëg nag, ag lëndëm a wàcc ca réew ma mépp, ba fukki waxtu ak juróom ca ngoon. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Wetu fukki waxtu ak juróom ca ngoon, ca la Yeesu àddu ca kaw ne: «Eli, Eli, lema sabaktani?» Loolu di tekki «Sama Yàlla, sama Yàlla, lu tax nga wacc ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 22.2.</note>?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ñenn ca ña fa taxaw dégg ca, ne: «Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char> de la kii di woo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ci kaw loolu kenn ca ñoom daw, jël ab sagar, xooj ko ci bineegar, lonk ci bant, tàllal ko ko, ngir mu naan. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Teewul ña ca des ne: «Bàyyil, nu seet ndax Ilyaas ay ñëw, wallu ko.» <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yeesu nag àddooti ca kaw, daldi yiwi noo ga.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ca saa sa ridob biir néegu Yàlla ba dale ca kaw ba ca suuf, xar ñaar, suuf sa yëngu, doj ya xar, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />bàmmeel ya ubbiku, néewi aji sell ñu bare ñu nelawoon, daldi dekki, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />génne ca bàmmeel ya. Gannaaw ba Yeesu dekkee, dugg nañu ca dëkk bu sell ba, ba feeñu ñu bare.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />
    <char style="w" lemma="njiitu takk-der b-:">Njiitu takk-der</char> ba ak ña àndoon ak moom di wattu Yeesu nag, ba ñu gisee suuf sa yëngu ak mboolem la xew, dañoo tiit lool, ba ne: «Aylayéwén kii <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> la.»<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ay jigéen ñu baree nga fa woon, dànd leen lu sore, di seetaan. Ña nga toppe woon Yeesu fa Galile, di ko toppatoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala ca la, ak Maryaama yaayu Yanqóoba ak Yuusufa, ak yaayu doomi Sebede ya.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rob nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ba ngoon jotee, jenn waay ju dëkke Arimate, ku Yàlla baaxe, ñu di ko wax Yuusufa, te muy taalibeb Yeesu moom ci boppam, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />moo dem ca <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char>, laaj ko néewub Yeesu. Pilaat joxe ndigal, ñu jox ko ko. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Ci kaw loolu Yuusufa jël néew ba, sànge ko càngaayal lẽe lu set, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />denc ko ci <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeelu</char> doj bu bees, bu mu yattaloon boppam. Ba loolu amee mu béraŋ doj wu mag, ube ko buntu bàmmeel ba, daldi dem. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Fa la fekk Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala, ak meneen Maryaama ma, ñu toog janook bàmmeel ba.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ca ëllëg sa nag, topp ca bésub Waajalu Noflaay, <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya ñoo daje, dem ca Pilaat. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ñu ne ko: «Sang bi, danoo fàttaliku ne naxekat boobu daa waxoon ba muy dund ne: “Gannaaw ñetti fan dinaa dekki.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kon nag ngalla joxeel ndigal, ngir wattulu bàmmeelam, ba ca ñetteelu fanam, bala ay taalibeem dikk, sàcc néew bi, te naan askan wi, dekki na, te kon naxe gu mujj gi mooy yées gu njëkk ga.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilaat ne leen: «Am ngeen ay wattukat, demleen wattuji ko nu ngeen mane.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ñu dem nag, ngir sàmmi bàmmeel ba, daldi cay tay doj wa koy ub, boole ca teg fa ay wattukat.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu Almasi bi dekki na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Gannaaw <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> ba nag, ca bésub dibéer ba jiitu ca ayu bésu Yawut ya, Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala ak Maryaama meneen ma ñoo dem, seeti <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> ba. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ca saa sa suuf yëngu yëngu bu mag; am malaakam Boroom bi wàcce asamaan, dikk béraŋ doj wa, toog ca kaw. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Aw meloom a ngay niru melax, ay yéreem weex tàll. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Wattukat ya tiit di lox, ba mel ni ñu dee.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Malaaka ma nag àddu ne jigéen ña: «Buleen tiit. Xam naa ne Yeesu ma ñu daajoon ngeen di seet. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Nekku fi, nde dekki na, na mu ko waxe woon. Ñëwleen seet fi mu tëddoon, <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />te ngeen dem gaaw, wax ay taalibeem ne leen: “Dekki na te kat jiituji na leen Galile; foofa ngeen koy gise.” Lii maa leen ko wax.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ba loolu amee jigéen ña fëxe ca bàmmeel ba, ànd ak tiitaange ak mbég mu réy. Ñu daldi daw yégali ko taalibe ya.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ci biir loolu rekk Yeesu jekki dajeek ñoom, ne leen: «Jàmm ngeen am!» Ñu ne gurub, jàpp cay tànkam, sujjóotal ko. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yeesu ne leen: «Buleen tiit, demleen ne samay bokk, ñu dem Galile; foofa lañu may gise.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Naka lañuy dem, ndeke ñenn ca wattukat ya délsi nañu ca dëkk ba, ba àgge <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya mboolem la xew. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ba ñooña dajee ak magi askan wa, ba diisoo, xaalis bu takku lañu jox takk-der ya, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ne leen: «Dangeen di wax ne: “Ay taalibeem a dikk guddi, fekk nu nuy nelaw, ñu sàcc néewam.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Bu ci boroom dëkk bi jotee, noo koy naxtaan, te dinanu fexe ba ngeen mucc loraange.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Wattukat ya nag jël xaalis ba, daldi def la ñu leen sant. Mbir moomu law na ci biir Yawut yi ba bésub tey jii.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Fukki taalibe ya ak benn nag dem Galile, ba ca tund wa leen Yeesu digaloon. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ci kaw loolu ñu gis ko, daldi koy sujjóotal. Teewul ñenn ña am xel ñaar. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yeesu dikk ne leen: «Joxees na ma bépp sañ-sañ fa asamaan ak fi kaw suuf. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kon demleen sàkk ay taalibe ci xeet yépp, sóobleen leen ci ndox ci turu Baay bi ak Doom ji ak <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />te ngeen jàngal leen ñu sàmm mboolem li ma leen sant. Maa ngii nag, di nekk ak yeen bés bu nekk, ba kera àddina di tukki.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>